gs and combinations of keywords<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- the restrictions apply for all keyword advertising systems, especially Google AdWords and Bing Ads<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- the offer by generic keywords in using your own domain as display URL is allowed<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please agree with us regarding search engine marketing under the mentioned contact data.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Please also note our restrictions and general terms and conditions.<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">We look forward to a successful collaboration.&nbsp;We are at your disposal for further questions or prompts.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Your Strellson Affiliate Team<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Contact:<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">diva-e NEXT GmbH<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Email: strellson-affiliate@diva-e.com<\/span><\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<div class=\"col-lg-12\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px;\"><div id=\"termsFreeTextContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea \" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Restrictions SEM :<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>- Utilisation de la marque Strellson ou toute autre marque prot\u00e9g\u00e9e comme crit\u00e8re de r