tion<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Nous calculons votre commission sur le&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">prix de vente net<\/span>&nbsp;de l\u2019appareil. Vous recevez entre 0,5 % et 1,5 % du montant de la transaction (panier moyen \u00e0 hauteur de 750 \u20ac), selon la type de r\u00e9mun\u00e9ration qui vous sera attribu\u00e9 (plus d'infos dans l'onglet Commissions).<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>N\u2019h\u00e9sitez plus et rejoignez&nbsp;d\u00e8s aujourd\u2019hui notre programme d\u2019affiliation&nbsp;!<\/b><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Mots-cl\u00e9s : iPhone reconditionn\u00e9s, appareils photo d'occasion, smartphones d'occasion, produits Apple neufs et d'occasion, appareils \u00e9lectroniques, asgoodasnew<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Contact : raphael.grethen@asgoodasnew.com<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Pop-Up&nbsp;: non autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">SEA (Google AdWords, BING) : non autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Site-Under&nbsp;: non autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Cashback&nbsp;: autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Social reward&nbsp;: autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">E-mailing d\u00e9di\u00e9&nbsp;: autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Insertions newsletters&nbsp;: autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Affichage&nbsp;: autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Liens texte&nbsp;: autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Comparateurs de prix&nbsp;: autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Incentive \/ Programmes de fid\u00e9lit\u00e9&nbsp;: autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Clic de validation&nbsp;: autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Bon de r\u00e9duction&nbsp;: autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Slide in&nbsp;: autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Display PV \/ mediaformance&nbsp;: non autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Co-registration&nbsp;: autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Retargeting&nbsp;: non autoris\u00e9<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Liens sponsoris\u00e9s&nbsp;: sous conditions<\/li><\/ul>","url":"https:\/\/asgoodasnew.fr\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=12826&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:15.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T10:56:32.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":1,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"asgoodasnew.fr"}}  
