 padding: 0px;\"><b>What do we sell?<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Doggie Solutions sell a vast range of Dog products which include - Dog cages, crates, leads, collars, harnesses, Dog beds, mattresses, cushions, Dog I.D tags, Dog coats, toys, food, treats &amp; supplements.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Chris Cole<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Chris has been training dogs and competing in dog agility competitions since 1992. In 1995, Chris became involved in training animals for films and television shows. Among the many productions he has been involved in are 101 and 102 Dalmatians.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Between 1998 and 1999 Chris worked at the animal show at Universal Studios in Hollywood training dogs (including Beethoven) for the animal shows in Hollywood and Tokyo. In between his film and television assignments Chris has helped many people and their dogs overcome training and behavioural problems. He has also been involved in training a wide range of other species including birds, monkeys and apes. Chris competed in agility with his dog Cap. Their many achievements include qualifying and competing in the Championship Finals at Crufts in 2006 and 2007. Chris Cole and Cap qualified for the Great Britain team competing at the IFCS World Championships that took place in Belgium in May 2008, They won the silver medal only being beaten by Canada.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Cookie period - 30 days.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% Standard Commission.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Contact<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Doggie Solutions Facebook Page - http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/DoggieSolutions<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<div class=\"col-lg-12\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px; float: left; width: 870.25px;\"><div id=\"termsFreeTextContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea \" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We do not accept any sites that are of any illegal nature this includes libellous or defamatory sites, hacking sites, software copying\/piracy, hate, or racial hate sites.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Adult content, Age restricted products, Chat rooms are also forbidden for advertising.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">No form of behavoural retargetting is acceptable.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Only codes that are supplied to affiliates by www.doggiesolutions.co.uk are valid for affiliate use. Any codes that are found to be displayed on sites that are non-approved will result in commissions being declined.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Any changes to our policy that we make we will allow a 7 day notice period to our affiliates.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Cookie Period: 30 Days<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Commission: 5%<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Anyone found infringing on our terms will receive a warning and may have commissions reversed. We reserve the right to withhold commission during this time. Continuous infringement of these terms will result in suspension from the program.<\/p><div bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><br><\/div><\/div><\/div>","url":"https:\/\/www.doggiesolutions.co.uk\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=4348&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:13.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:44:27.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"doggiesolutions.co.uk"}}  
