 style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr, Selencia, Accezz<\/span>).<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">This concerns the exact brand (e.g.&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr, Selencia, Accezz<\/span>), misspellings of the brand (e.g.&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquetelephone.fr, Coqdetelephone.fr, Coquedetelefone.fr, Acezz, Accez, iMoshon, iMoshoin, Selenzia, Selensia, Salencia<\/span>) and brand names in combination with other words (for example&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr iPhone X case, Selencia Samsung Galaxy Note 9 case, Accezz USB cable<\/span>).<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Use of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;brand names or combinations thereof, related\/misspellings in advertisement text and\/or visible URL in the form of domain or subdomain (<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephonefr.mydomain.de<\/span>&nbsp;is therefore not allowed,&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">mydomain.de\/Coquedetelephonefr<\/span>&nbsp;is allowed).<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Advertising of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;products via the CSS module of and on the Google Shopping platform.<\/p><\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>2. EMAIL MARKETING<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Email marketing is only allowed within the affiliate program of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;with exceptional permission from&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;and subject to a number of conditions:<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The Publisher must be demonstrably compliant with the provisions of all relevant legislation and regulations;<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Only email addresses obtained through a double opt-in and compliant according to (among other things) relevant regulations may be used;<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The publisher must adhere to the rules of conduct established by Awin in the Awin Code of Conduct. Awin must be in possession of a signed version of the Awin Code of Conduct so that it is transferable at all times at request.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The name&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;and the aforementioned brand names may not be used in the sender of e-mails;<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Publishers are not allowed to impersonate an official representation of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;in the promotion via email;<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The Publisher is responsible for any consequences imposed if it is or has been guilty of sending spam or sending e-mails that are in any way not compliant with the above legislation, codes of conduct and\/or guidelines;<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">It is necessary that all e-mails\/newsletters to be sent are submitted in advance to&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;for approval via the E-mail Approval Tool, so that written permission can be given by&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;prior to sending the e-mail\/newsletter. This includes all e-mail communications, newsletters, self-developed texts, images, logos and trademark material.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Sending e-mail batches is only allowed in consultation (see also previous point) with&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>. It must be indicated on which dates it is intended to send the e-mails, stating the expected number of e-mails per sending moment.<\/p><\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>3. TYPO \/ MISspell DOMAIN NAMES<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Not allowed:<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Registering domain names that resemble, are related to or are a misspelling of the advertiser's trademark; for example&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquetelephone.fr, Coqdetelephone.fr, Coquedetelefone.fr, www.Coquedetelephone.fr, www.acezz.de, www.accez.de or www.selenzia.de, www.selensia.de<\/span>.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Registering domain names that resemble, are related to or are a misspelling of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr's<\/span>&nbsp;products and services, for example&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">www.coquedetelephone-accessory.fr<\/span>.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Using subdomains similar to, related to or misspelling the&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;brand or related products and services. For example&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">http:\/\/Coquedetelephonefr.mydomain.de&nbsp;<\/span>or h<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">ttp:\/\/phoneaccessories-Coquedetelephone.mydomain.fr.<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Allowed:<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Using directories (mydomain.de\/directory) that contain the&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;brand or&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;services provided that the spelling is correct. For example&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">http:\/\/www.mydomain.de\/Coquedetelephonefr-phoneaccessories.