dding: 0px;\">It is not allowed to use offline marketing activities or press releases in the name of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;without prior written permission from&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Use of logos or trademark material in account\/profile (at social media sites) is not allowed.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The website of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;may not be loaded in an iframe within social media apps, pages or profiles.<\/p><\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Allowed:<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Acting as an intermediary (for own account, not as&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>) in accordance with the rules that apply to this as drawn up by the AFM and regular legislation. Offering the&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;proposition is therefore only allowed within the legal frameworks that apply to the relevant publisher; consequences for violations are at the expense of the publisher. The Publisher must therefore act in accordance with the AFM rules and may under no circumstances link directly. In case of doubt, it is wise to contact the AFM or&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;(via affiliate@smartphonehoesjes.nl).<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Use of (social) media for traffic to your own website.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Refer to the official&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;accounts to increase customer relevance.<\/p><\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>5. COUPON CODE AND DISCOUNT CODE WEBSITES<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coupon or discount code websites are allowed within the affiliate program of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;provided that only discount codes are used that:<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">are distributed through the media channels of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>. Excluded are exclusive discount codes that are made available to newsletter members.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">exclusively for the publisher who distributes this discount code, was created by&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">It is NOT allowed to distribute discount codes that deviate from the above two points (including discount codes that have been created exclusively for third parties). If in doubt about whether or not a discount code may be distributed, the publisher should always first contact affiliate@smartphonehoesjes.nl. Distribution of the discount code is only allowed after obtaining permission from&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>. If a publisher violates the above rules,&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;has the right to reject all pending transactions from this publisher, to immediately suspend the respective publisher and to deny access to the affiliate program.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>6. PROHIBITED SITES<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The following sites are emphatically not allowed within the&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;affiliate program:<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Sites of a pornographic or violent nature;<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Sites that include or promote illegal activities;<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Sites that are discriminatory or offensive;<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Sites that infringe copyrights;<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Harm the name and reputation of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>7. DIRECT LINKING, POP-UPS, POP-UNDER, CLOAKING<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">See explanation regarding the topics direct linking, pop-ups, pop-under and cloaking below:<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Direct linking through pop-ups, pop-unders, etc. is not allowed. Other forms of \"cookie dropping\" are also not allowed;<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">It is also not allowed to use applications or toolbars in promotions, whether or not to influence the last cookie;<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Cloaking links or faking the referrer is expressly not allowed. It must be clear at all times what the source of the traffic is.<\/p><\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>8. CASHBACK WEBSITES &amp; SAVINGS PROGRAMS<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Cashback websites are possible under&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">strict conditions<\/span>:<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">It should be obvious that the compensation is not given by&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">It must be clearly stated that the compensation is provided by the Publisher.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;has no influence on this fee and cannot change it.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Reimbursements must be stated in points or forms other than Euros.<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Reimbursements must always be agreed and approved in advance by&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;via affiliate@Coquedetelephone.fr.<\/p><\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>9. SPECIFIC GUIDELINES<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;uses a&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">'basket freeze'<\/span>. The source that ensures that (1) a consumer ends up on the webshop of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">www.Coquedetelephone.fr&nbsp;<\/span>and (2) of which the same consumer also adds a product to the shopping cart in that session, is considered the directly responsible source for the generation of the transaction.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The moment a product is added to the cart, this resource is temporarily pinned. If, after filling the shopping cart, a consumer searches for a discount and comes back to the&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coquedetelephone.fr<\/span>&nbsp;webshop via a third source, the first source remains responsible for generating the transaction. As soon as this 'directly responsible source' concerns a publisher and the consumer completes the order, the compensation is definitively allocated to this publisher on the thank you page.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>10. OTHER<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The right remains to exclude publishers without giving any reason and\/or reject sales if:<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">there is uncertainty about the source of the traffic;<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">sales are realized for which no publisher ID and\/or transaction ID is known;<\/p><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">the stated conditions are not complied with.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Publishers are solely responsible for keeping the promotional material on their media up-to-date. Any discontinued promotions must be removed by the publisher or replaced with newly available material.<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.ploonk.fr\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=25409&id=1263017