.com"],"short_description":"Archiproducts is the Furniture and Design e-commerce point of reference for architects, designers and design lovers. With 12 categories on sale - from Furniture to Lighting to Finishes - it is the official dealer of 800 international brands.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Welcome to the Archiproducts US affiliate programme<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Archiproducts is the Furniture and Design e-commerce point of reference for a global community of architects, designers and design lovers looking for iconic products and innovation. With 12 categories on sale - from Furniture to Lighting, from Outdoor to Contract, from Bathroom to Finishes - today it is the official dealer of 800 international brands, including Flos, Poltrona Frau, Vitra, Knoll, Artemide, Zanotta, Moroso , Artek, Tacchini, Casamania &amp; Horm and many others.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Our mission is to be&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">the most accredited digital platform in the world of design<\/span>, uniting creators, companies, professionals, enthusiasts and users. On Archiproducts every day you can find news, updates and information from the world of furniture and architecture.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Why join our affiliate programme now:<\/span><\/h4><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">We are the e-commerce site with the largest number of TOP brands in the world of furniture, lighting and Outdoor furnishings<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">A wide choice and promotions that are always ongoing<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Low return rates<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Higher than average commissions 7%<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Duration of cookies: 30 days<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Fare clic qui per aggiungere TerminiPartners who join the Archiproducts affiliate programme must comply with the following conditions:<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">APPROVAL<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">To join our programme we will need to approve your website. We are looking for partners in line with our goals and values. We reserve the right to discontinue the activity or refuse participation in the programme at any time.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">CREATIVITY<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You can use the creatives and links provided by Archiproducts and included in the programme. The modification or alteration of banners, logos or links is NOT permitted. We are available to provide new creatives or formats if requested or to approve proposed solutions. Everything must be submitted before publication, writing to: partnerprogram@archiproducts.com<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">PPC CAMPAIGNS<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Brand, product or generic PPC activities connected to our site and all the products therein are permitted only with our approve. If orders are generated deriving from search engine campaigns without approve, these will not be considered valid and we will proceed to interrupt the collaboration with the partner.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u200b<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">CONTENTS AND PROMOTIONS<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Remarketing and retargeting activities are prohibited.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Activities on sites in a language other than Italian are not allowed (specify the language of each programme).<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Posting offensive or discriminatory content, political, pornographic, erotic references or information dangerous to people's health is prohibited.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">For publishers who post content on social networks, posts or stories, they must report in the hashtags (#) that they are ads #ad.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We reserve the right to block advertisers from posting content that does not comply with brand guidelines.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">PROMOTIONAL CODES<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The advertiser may only use the promotional codes, coupons, provided by Archiproducts in the AWIN programme. Transactions generated with coupons that are unauthorised or not provided for by the AWIN programme will not be considered or attributed to the partner.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">It is not permitted to promote, share or communicate promotions or promotional codes other than those expressly provided for by the programme and authorised by Archiproducts.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">VALIDATION OF TRANSACTIONS<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Before confirming the commissions, Archiproducts reserves the right to check and validate the conversions and to pay only those that have been created in accordance with the general conditions.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Orders (valid registration of users on the Archiproducts website or app) are subject to a verification process according to internal criteria and key performance indicators. Archiproducts, therefore, reserves the right to refuse payment of commissions on cancelled and returned orders.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Validation will take place no later than 45 days from the transaction and only valid last-click conversions will be remunerated. In the event of a violation, the advertiser reserves the right to cancel all ongoing transactions until the violation is confirmed and to terminate the partnership without notice.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u200bIn the event of a violation of our terms and\/or brand guidelines, the collaboration may be suspended. For any questions, please contact partnerprogram@archiproducts.com e Condizioni<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.archiproducts.com\/en","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=43635&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:06:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T10:56:31.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":1,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"archiproducts.com"}}  
