gin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Free<\/span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;shipping in Germany from EUR 29.00<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Safe and convenient payment methods<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Free samples<\/span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;and special sizes<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Delivery time in 1-3 working days<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Excellent service \u2013 close to the customer and personal<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Great discount campaigns<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Lots of \u201c&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Made in Germany<\/span><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;\u201d products<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Note on discount &amp; voucher campaigns:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Voucher applications are only permitted with prior agreement and individual approval.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Advertisements may only be made using the discount and voucher campaigns provided.&nbsp;An application for on-site promotions and codes as well as r