active deals on a wide range of diamonds, jewellery and watches<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>What we can offer:<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 day cookie period and fantastic opportunities to earn more through cross-selling<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">A variety of tools available<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">A simple deep linking process<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Full time account management and support<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Competitive commissions<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Average order value of: \u00a3400<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Site Visitors: Over 1 million\/year<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Exclusive imagery<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Terms &amp; Conditions for Affiliate Cashback<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Chisholm Hunter offers a 30-day return\/refund policy to all of our customers from the date of despatch, commission will not be paid on items that have been returned or refunded inside this period, for this reason, commissions will only be verified 30 days from the date of despatch. Purchases bought using interest free credit may cause your cashback to be declined or reduced. Purchases bought using additional discount that reduces your overall purchase price may cause your cashback to be declined or reduced. e.g Voucher codes, student discount, staff discount etc.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; marg