 violence or unseemly behaviour.&nbsp; Any sites not appropriate to our brand.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Only Chisholm Hunter approved publishers may sell Chisholm Hunter products over the phone.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Without express permission to sell to customers over the phone, any publisher found engaging in this activity&nbsp;will be immediately removed from the programme and their commission's will be declined.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Subnetworks<\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">If you operate a subnetwork through your publisher account you must inform the Chisholm Hunter affiliate team and a list of all URLs promoting Chisholm Hunter should be supplied. Chisholm Hunter reserve the right to decline individual URLs if not deemed editorially appropriate.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Any URL providing more than 5% of your sales volume should be tracked into a secondary PID for legal and audit purposes unless agreed otherwise in writing with Chisholm Hunter.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Any URL which joins a subnetwork will join on the Standard Awin Programme rates unless agreed otherwise in writing with Chisholm Hunter.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Failure to adhere to these conditions may result in immediate removal from the Chisholm Hunter programme of either the URL and \/ or where necessary, the subnetwork.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Disputed transactions<\/b><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The merchant will investigate disputed transactions within 75 days from submission.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Affiliate Removals<\/b><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Awin will review all affiliates on a monthly basis who have been inactive for the past three months. Inactive is defined in this instance as any affiliate who has not driven a sale within that time period. This may result in removal from the programme. Those affiliates who have been removed through inactivity are welcome to re-apply to the programme, but must go through the approval process once again.&nbsp;<\/p><div bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><br><\/div><\/div><\/div>","url":"https:\/\/www.chisholmhunter.co.uk\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=16071&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-05-10T19:00:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T10:56:45.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":1,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"chisholmhunter.co.uk"}}  
