-5efb-4ab2-9e21-323cc45d9813"],"valid_domains":["*.zavvi.com","zavvi.com","zavvi.cn"],"short_description":"Established in 2009, Zavvi has established itself as a market leading, specialist entertainment retailer for ever-popular Video Games, DVD, Blu-ray and our new selection of exclusive Steelbooks, clothing, toys, gadgets and more.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Zavvi International Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">About Zavvi.com&nbsp;<\/span>We Know Entertainment.<\/b><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Zavvi.com has established itself as a specialist entertainment retailer for all things Pop Culture, with a wide range of products from Exclusive Collectibles, Steelbooks and Vinyl all the way through to Lego, Novelty Gifts and Officially Licensed Merchandise.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Our affiliates enjoy daily deals, regular price drops, updated special offers, as well as the chance to check out and pre-order all the hottest and most sought after products. Whether you\u2019re looking to find the latest collectible, a hot new Lego set, or clothing from your favourite franchise, find it all and more on Zavvi.com.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Why promote Zavvi.com?<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Work with a brand who share your community\u2019s passions<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Competitive pricing for customers, with great savings and bundles<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Exclusive collections from fantastic franchises<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 day cookie length<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Exclusive discounts and promotions for our affiliates.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Regular affiliate newsletters with updated promotions for your site<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Mobile and App compatible: The Zavvi site is mobile and app optimised and affiliate sales will track through both platforms.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Commission Structure<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">New Customer<\/span><\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">5%: New Customers (Excluding Technology)<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">0.5%: Technology<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Existing Customer<\/span><\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">1%: Existing Customers (Excluding Technology)<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">0.5%: Technology<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">ZBOX&nbsp;Subscription: \u00a35<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">30 Day Cookie<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please note: Pre-order sales will be validated once the item has been released so may remain pending for some time.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>PPC Policy<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Please see our Terms Tab for full details on our PPC Policy.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Voucher Codes<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Please see Terms Tab for full details on our Voucher Code policy.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We also have many international programmes as we ship worldwide \u2013 if you are interested in these please get in touch.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>General Guidelines<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Discount codes Policy<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We encourage affiliates to contact us for exclusive voucher\/discount codes and additional incentives.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates may only promote codes that are provided through the affiliate program (either through our account or directly from the Affiliate Manager).<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We reserve the right to withhold payment of commission if unauthorized voucher codes are used in an affiliate sale. We appreciate that consumers may use voucher codes that they have found via a site other than that which is awarded the sale and this will be investigated before decisions on commission payment are made. Any affiliate found to be displaying unauthorized codes may also have their commission set to zero until the code(s) are removed.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Where voucher codes are issued with an expiry date this should be clearly displayed, and codes should be removed or explicitly marked as expired after this date unless you are advised otherwise. Any affiliates displaying expired codes without marking them as being expired may be suspended from the program. Please also ensure that you observe the IAB voucher code best practice guidelines.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Affiliate PPC Guidelines<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The Hut Group operates a strict policy on Paid Search activity. These Terms and Conditions are applicable on any advertising platform, including, but not limited to, search engines, advertising networks and social media placements.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">These Affiliate PPC restrictions apply to and include The Hut Group parent site, its sister sites and any of its subsidiaries.<\/span><\/p><p style