from the latest smart tech and TVs, to all-singing, all-dancing washing machines, fridges and ovens.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">AO.com Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">AO Affiliate Programme<\/span>&nbsp;<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You won\u2019t find anyone more passionate about tech and electricals than us. Our Online Electricals Store has everything from the latest smart tech and TVs, to all-singing, all-dancing washing machines, fridges and&nbsp;ovens.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We\u2019ll help you pick the perfect laptop for that last-minute homework, deliver you a TV for your latest boxset binge, and keep in touch with updates when your cooker\u2019s in the back of our truck.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Nothing pleases us more than dropping off a shiny new fridge in its new home. Trouble is, old fridges are pretty tricky to dispose of. That\u2019s why we built our very own recycling plant to safely do it for&nbsp;us.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We\u2019ll take away your old appliance, lovingly crush it in our clever machine and recycle the bits that come out the other end. So, you can rest easy knowing you\u2019ve done your bit, and we\u2019ll rest easy knowing we\u2019ve saved you a trip to the&nbsp;tip!<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">UK\u2019s Most Trusted Electrical Retailer. To verify trust, visit&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/ao.com\/trust\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">https:\/\/ao.com\/trust<\/a>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Why Promote AO?<\/span><\/h4><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Fast &amp; free delivery<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Quick installation offered<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Finance options available on 1000s of products<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Competitive pricing \u2013 AO checks every price, everywhere, everyday<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">8 million site views a month and growing<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 day cookie period<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Inhouse affiliate team<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Exclusive affiliate discounts and promotions<\/li><\/ul><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Commission Rates<\/span><\/h4><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Minimum 0.4% commission with opportunity to set up higher bespoke rates<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"marg