The Art Home Gym Equipment  & So Much More With Work Out Videos - Community Support And Reviews. Free Nation Wide Shipping- 12 Month Warranty & Repairs. Default Commission 10%","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Bluefin Fitness UK Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.bluefinfitness.com\/\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">www.BlueFinFitness.com<\/a>&nbsp;We are a UK based company with international order fulfillment meaning you can monetize your site traffic.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Our default commission is 10% on all referred sales.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Our average order basket value is between&nbsp;\u00a3239 and&nbsp;\u00a3259 and our site conversions have a low at 8% and a high of 12%.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Demographics are almost split between men and women.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">As we know, going to the Gym during a pandemic is problematic and consumers are buying our products so they can do their work out at home.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We offer product video tutorials as well as work out suggestions not only from us but from consumers who love our products.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">A holistic approach to customer satisfaction.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We love our affiliates and those who have significant followers on social media or have a blog with targeted traffic, drop us a line for a free product in exchange for a review. We have a 4.05 average rating out of 1267 reviews.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In addition to the above, it's all about converting your referred traffic right? We have daily specials for the budget-conscious<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.bluefinfitness.com\/special-offers\/\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">Special offers | Fitness Equipment Shop | Massage Vibration Plates for Weight Loss and Fitness (bluefinfitness.com)<\/a><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We accommodate industry sized banners including mobile and social.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We have amazing quality lifestyle images and videos available on request.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Data feed preloaded text links and offers.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Dedicated Affiliate Managers<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Your Affiliate Manager is Jessica&nbsp;<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Jessica at bluefintrading.co.uk&nbsp;<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Our Affiliate Program has been designed to be fair and we expect each affiliate and Bluefin Trading Ltd&nbsp;to both be responsible&nbsp;for ensuring we are giving your referred traffic, our potential customers a great experience. This means we are vigilant about our offers and the redemption of our offers.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We require all affiliates to have current information on their ad space, at the very least an expiry date.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We do not accept affiliates who do dropship, it's a risky gamble for you and for us as we have high stock turnover and new product launches and refurbished items that can go out of stock quickly on some products.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We are not accepting generic coupon sites at this moment.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We are already working with a few coupon driven sites.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You may use product images from the site, however, you must download them and not link directly to them.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You may not use reviewer content as this content belongs to the reviewer.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You may use our content from our blog&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.bluefinfitness.com\/blog\/\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">Bluefin Fitness Blog: to help you with product information and fitness tips!<\/a><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">If we give you a product to review, you will contractually bound to review it within two weeks of receipt.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We will send you a contract prior to issuing a free product.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You will have a relevant target audience and can prove your number of followers and or unique visitors per month.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We will be clawing back commissions based on the following.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Duplicate Orders.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Commission allocated to another marketing channel which was the last click.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Canceled Orders<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Returns.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Fraudulent Transactions.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliate breaking terms and conditions.<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.bluefinfitness.com\/