4939-ab0e-9855a2713450"],"valid_domains":["ticombo.com","*.ticombo.com"],"short_description":"Ticombo ist der erste Ticket-Marktplatz, auf dem Fans auf eine faire, einfache und sichere Art und Weise kaufen und verkaufen k\u00f6nnen. TrustScore von 4,7","description":"<h2 class=\"margin-top-sm\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.25; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Ticombo DE Affiliate Program<\/h2><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00dcber uns&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Unsere Mission ist es, allen Fans Zugang zu ihren Lieblings-Live-Events zu erm\u00f6glichen. Ticombo ist der erste Ticket-Marktplatz, auf dem Veranstalter, Wiederverk\u00e4ufer und Fans ihre Tickets auf eine faire, einfache und sichere Art und Weise kaufen und verkaufen k\u00f6nnen. Mit einem wachsenden internationalen Team von Business- und Technologie-Rockstars im Herzen von Berlin arbeiten wir hart daran, die transparenteste Ticket-Plattform f\u00fcr Fans auf der ganzen Welt zu schaffen.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Der Kauf von Tickets f\u00fcr Events sollte genauso viel Spa\u00df machen wie das Event selbst. Schluss mit unfairen Ticketpreisen, unerreichbaren Kundendienst-Hotlines und unzuverl\u00e4ssigen Ticketverk\u00e4ufern. Um das beste Fan-Erlebnis zu erreichen, konzentrieren wir uns auf kundenorientiertes Design, ein hohes Kundendienst-Niveau und starke internationale Partner.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Ticombo hat wesentlich niedrigere Geb\u00fchren als viele unserer Konkurrenten, was oft zu einer wesentlich h\u00f6heren Conversion Rate f\u00fchrt<\/span>.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Als&nbsp;Partner erhalten Sie 6 % vom Nettoeinkaufspreis. Wir verwenden eine 30-t\u00e4gige Cookie-Dauer. Der Verkauf wird sp\u00e4testens 10 Tage nach dem Veranstaltungsdatum validiert.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Verbinden Sie uns heute!<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\"><u style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">AFFILIATE PROGRAM TERMS<\/u><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">THIS AFFILIATE PROGRAM AGREEMENT, (hereinafter, the \u201c<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Agreement<\/span>\u201d) sets out the following General Terms and Conditions (hereinafter, the \"<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Terms<\/span>\") that govern the relationship between Ticombo (hereinafter, \u201c<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Ticombo<\/span>\") and Affiliates (hereinafter, the \u201c<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Affiliate<\/span>\u201d) who participate in our Affiliate Program. By joining Ticombo\u2019s Affiliate Program (hereinafter, \u201c<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">our Affiliate Program<\/span>\u201d), the Affiliate agrees to be bound by these Terms, which set out the rules and guidelines for participation in the program.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">This Affiliate Program allows publishers to earn a commission by promoting tickets advertised through Ticombo\u2019s platform through their website and\/or social media channels. These Terms outline the commission rate and payment terms, marketing guidelines, compliance with laws and regulations, intellectual property rights, representations and warranties, indemnification obligations, term and termination, confidentiality, governing law, and miscellaneous provisions.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Please read these Terms carefully before joining our Affiliate Program. By participating in our affiliate program, the Affiliate agrees to comply with all applicable laws and regulations.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Commission and Payment<\/span><\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">The Affiliate shall use its advertising channels in order to promote tickets listed on the Ticombo platform, ensuring that all advertising and promotional materials used by the Affiliate are truthful, accurate and not misleading. The Affiliate shall ensure that the promotion and advertisement of tickets listed on the Ticombo platform comply with all guidelines and instructions provided by Ticombo, as well as any applicable laws and regulations.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Subject to the Terms of this Agreement, Ticombo shall pay the Affiliate commission equal to six percent (6%) of the net sales price (excluding any applicable taxes) (hereinafter, the \u201c<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Commission<\/span>\u201d) of tickets purchased by customers who have accessed Ticombo\u2019s platform through the Affiliate\u2019s advertisement or promotional channel. Commission payments shall be made on a monthly basis. No Commission shall be paid for purchases made by customers who did not access the platform through the Affiliate's advertisements.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Ticombo shall have the right to cancel and\/or withhold the payment of any commissions from sales if it has reasonable grounds to believe that the Affiliate may have breached these Terms or applicable laws and regulations.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">The Affiliate agrees to provide, when requested, any accurate and up-to-date payment and tax information necessary for Ticombo to process the Commission payments. The Affiliate further acknowledges and agrees that it is solely responsible for any and all taxes, fees, or other charges incurred in connection with the receipt of Commission payments under this Agreement.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Marketing Guidelines<\/span><\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">The Affiliate shall, at all times, perform the promotional and advertisement of tickets listed on the Ticombo platform&nbsp;<u style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">in accordance and in compliance with all applicable laws and regulations<\/u>. The promotion and advertisement of tickets listed on the Ticombo platform shall&nbsp;<u style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">not be performed on search engines<\/u>, and it shall solely be conducted through other advertising channels.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">All promotion and advertisement of tickets shall be done with the materials provided by Ticombo\u2019s team. Ticombo reserves the right to review and approve any advertising.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Intellectual Property Rights<\/span><\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">Subject to the Terms of this Agreement, Ticombo grants the Affiliate a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to use its trademarks, logos, and service marks (collectively, the \"<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Trademarks<\/span>\") solely for the purpose of promoting Ticombo\u2019s platform and services through the Affiliate\u2019s advertising channels as part of the Affiliate Program, pursuant to the Marketing Guidelines in Section 2. This license does not grant the Affiliate any ownership or other rights in the Trademarks.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">The Affiliate agrees that it shall only use the Trademarks in the form and manner approved by Ticombo, and will comply with any guidelines, policies, and instructions provided by Ticombo regarding the use of the Trademarks. The Affiliate shall not use the Trademarks in any manner that is likely to cause confusion, deception, or damage to our reputation, or that would violate any applicable law or regulation.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">The Affiliate acknowledges that Ticombo is the sole owner of the Trademarks, and that its use of the Trademarks will not create any right, title, or interest in the Trademarks other than the license granted herein. The Affiliate agrees to promptly cease all use of the Trademarks upon termination of its participation in the Affiliate Program.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Representations and Warranties<\/span><\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">By participating in our Affiliate Program, the Affiliate warrants and represents that:<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, 