><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Partners are not permitted to use any mis-spell domains which could be confused with our own website or that of any of our industry partners<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Partners must not mask or cloak their URLs<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Embedding our website or content in an Iframe is strictly forbidden<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Branding Restrictions<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">All partners must ensure that any Gardenesque logos and brand descriptions are up to date<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">No amendments are permitted to be made to our copyright protected assets<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">All offers listed on partner sites must be kept up to date and in-line with our own terms and conditions<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Voucher Codes<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Comission will not be paid when a&nbsp;Voucher Code,&nbsp;that has not been directly supplied by Gardenesque&nbsp;to the affiliate, is used by a customer.&nbsp;<\/p>","url":"http:\/\/www.gardenesque.com\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=25385&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:06:00.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:46:13.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"gardenesque.com"}}  
