s, but above all by their ease of use and reliability in whitening teeth.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h6 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Become an affiliate partner of DiamondSmile - your opportunities as a publisher:<\/span><\/h6><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">A white smile and clean teeth are a sign of a well-groomed appearance. This opens many doors. Our publishers get the best teeth whitening products in Europe from us.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h6 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Your 6 most important advantages:<\/span><\/h6><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Commissions of up to 30%.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">High shopping cart value - on average over 63\u20ac.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Above average cookie lifetime: 30 days more.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">More than 70.000 Monthly Unique Visitors alone in Germany, Austria &amp; Switzerland &amp; more than 150.000 Monthly Unique Visitors across Europe.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Cancellation rate below 1%.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Individual additional services such as personal coupon codes, free product samples and raffles.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h6 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Further advantages for you:<\/span><\/h6><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Attractive niche market (teeth whitening, dating, beauty &amp; health).<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">All products have the appropriate certificates, seals of approval and T\u00dcVs. (CE, FDA, ISO, MSDS).<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Personal contact person who is always available for questions and suggestions.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Well-known in the press and on television (Spiegel, FOCUS, Brigitte, Stern).<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">High profile in social media (Instagram, bloggers, etc.).<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Personal contact person who is always available for your questions and suggestions.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Many different advertising materials for immediate use (royalty-free product images, banners, GIFS, etc.).<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Optimized website with sales-promoting elements (crossed-out prices, social proof through verified testimonials and sales popups, etc.).<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">99.1% positive feedback from customers.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">More than 28% repeat buyers.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h6 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-