ltweit f\u00fchrende Plattform f\u00fcr die Buchung von Reiseaktivit\u00e4ten und Dienstleistungen.  Unseren Kunden stehen t\u00e4glich mehr als 100.000 Angeboten an \u00fcber 400 Reisezielen zur Verf\u00fcgung.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Klook DE Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Welcome to Klook Affiliate Programme!<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">With a portfolio of over 100,000+ travel attractions and activities across the world, Klook\u2019s Affiliate Program is the leading program of its kind in the world. We offer the most competitive rates in the market, ensuring our affiliate partners the highest conversions.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Every feature of our affiliate program, from our multi-currency and multilingual interface to our online tools and best-in-class tech support, is designed to enable you to easily adapt to the program and monetize your traffic optimally.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>What kind of product you will find on Klook:&nbsp;<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Theme park tickets&nbsp; (inc. Disney, Universal, Europapark, etc)<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Tickets and tours to main attractions (like Louvre Museum, Burj Khalifa, Empire State Building, etc)<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Guided tours all over the world<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Transportation solutions: rail tickets, busses, airport transfers, car rental and more<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Travel services: museum passes, wifi routers, sim cards<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Hotels and staycation&nbsp;packages&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">And many more!<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>So why Klook?<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- The most competitive rates<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Experiences all over the globe in local languages<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Instant confirmation and simple cancellation policy for the majority of products<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Program Highlights:<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Between 2% - 5% Commission Depending on the&nbsp;Activity&nbsp;purchased<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 Day Referral Period<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">60 days validation period<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Dedicated Account Manager<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Terms and Conditions<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Base Commission terms<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for&nbsp;Attractions &amp; Shows<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for&nbsp;Tours &amp; Sightseeing<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for&nbsp;Food &amp; Dining<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for&nbsp;Activities &amp; Experiences<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for&nbsp;Transport &amp; Wi-Fi<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for Hotel<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for Attraction Passes<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for Car Rentals<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">2% for&nbsp;Special Activities<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">There is a 30-day cookie length on the Klook programme.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Voucher Codes&nbsp;<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates may only promote codes that are provided through the&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook&nbsp;<\/span>affiliate programme (either by AWIN or&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook&nbsp;<\/span>).<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook&nbsp;<\/span>reserves the right to withhold payment of commission if affiliates promote an unauthorised voucher code. Any affiliate found to be displaying unauthorised codes may also have their commission set to zero until the code(s) are removed.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Where voucher codes are issued with an expiry date this should be clearly displayed, and codes should be removed or explicitly marked as expired after this date unless you are advised otherwise. Any affiliates displaying expired codes without marking them as expired may be suspended from the programme. Please also ensure that you observe the IAB voucher code best practice guidelines.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Affiliate PPC Guidelines<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook&nbsp;<\/span>operates a strict policy on Paid Search activity including, but not limited to, search engines, advertising networks and social media placements. We do not allow paid search activity of any kind without the consent of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook<\/span>. Consistent breach of this may result in commissions being declined and potentially being suspended from the programme.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Keywords<\/b><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In order to avoid any keyword matching issues, affiliates must add the following keywords as negative broad match to any and allPaid Search activity:<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Disneyland Paris, hong kong disneyland (due to the restriction imposed by HKDL), klook, klook deal, klook discount, klook hong kong, klook japan, klook korea, klook osaka, klook promo code, klook promo kode, klook code, klook discount code, klook discount, klook voucher, klook voucher code, klook coupon, klook coupon code, klook promotion, klook singapore, klook tokyo, klook travel, k look, k look hk, kllok, kk look, klook app, klook code, klook discount, klook hk, klook \u512a\u60e0, klook \u9999\u6e2f, \u5ba2\u8def, \u5ba2\u8def \u9999\u6e2f, klook china, klook \u4e2d\u56fd, klook \u4f18\u60e0, klook \u4f18\u60e0 \u7801, klook \u7968, klook\u4f18\u60e0, klook\u5ba2\u8def, klook\u8ba2\u7968, klook\u8bc4\u4ef7, \u5ba2 \u8def \u4f18\u60e0, \u5ba2 \u8def \u8bc4\u4ef7, \u5ba2\u8def, \u5ba2\u8def\u65c5\u884c, klook \ubc1c\ub9ac, klook \uc608\uc57d, klook \ucfe0\ud3f0, klook \ud560\uc778, klook \ud560\uc778\ucf54\ub4dc, klook \ud64d\ucf69, \ucf00\uc774\ub8e9, \ud074\ub8e9, \ud074\ub8e9\uc5b4\ud50c, \ud074\ub8e9\uc608\uc57d, \ud074\ub8e9\uc640\uc774\ud30c\uc774, \ud074\ub8e9\uc720\ub2c8\ubc84\uc124, \ud074\ub8e9\ud560\uc778, \ud074\ub8e9\ud560\uc778\ucf54\ub4dc, \ud074\ub8e9\ud560\uc778\ucfe0\ud3f0, \u30af\u30eb\u30c3\u30af, and other klook + destination KWs or any variations including misspellings, alternate spellings, alternate spacing, or any phrases that include these terms<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Launches<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">There will be select high profile launches that&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook&nbsp;<\/span>will not pay any commission on. These will be communicated by Awin through the news manager within 24 hours of the product releasing. Please ensure you are subscribed to receive these emails. No launch products should be communicated by affiliates unless communicated by Awin or&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook<\/span>. Any products promoted before the agreed launch time will result in decline of the sale.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook&nbsp;<\/span>has the right to cancel any commissions from sales they believe has breached these terms.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We do not allow affiliates to scrape the site for a product. All affiliates must use the feeds provided as a means of accessing the product.<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.klook.com\/de\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=22316&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-30T19:00:33.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:44:24.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"klook.com"}}  
