rsnyc.com"],"short_description":"Chelsea Peers From bed to beach, we are a Modern lounging brand that focuses on affordable, quality, sustainable lounge and beachwear.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Chelsea Peers NYC Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Who are we?<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">From bed to beach, we are a Modern lounging brand that focuses on affordable, quality, sustainable lounge and beachwear.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Why shop with us?<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">The lazy mornings and even lazier afternoons. The loungewear you could do nothing in, but also wear to host a party.&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">We've made it our mission to become more sustainable as a brand. We've teamed up with&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/repreve.com\/\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">REPREVE\u00ae<\/a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/onetreeplanted\/\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">@onetreeplanted<\/a>&nbsp;in a conscious effort to work together in our ongoing commitment to create a greener, more sustainable fashion industry.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0