ottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please note - do not use naked links to link to Sweatband.com. Any affiliate found doing this will be removed from the programme with immediate effect.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">If we discover affiliates breaching these terms we may void sales and remove affiliates from the program.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">______________________________________________________________________________________<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">If you have any queries, please contact Izabela Rek at iza@sweatband.com<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":null,"url":"https:\/\/www.sweatband.com","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=2537&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-04-14T19:00:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T11:04:13.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":1,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"sweatband.com"}}  
