left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Paid Search: You may not bid on the name, variations of the name, Name + Coupon, Name + Discount.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You may use the name in your descriptions, you may link directly to the website.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You may use negative keywords. If you see BLUEFINTRADING Official PPC bidding, do not bid above them.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Coupon sites: You may not promote past offers, consumers don't want to see what they could have gotten.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You must promote offers that are current.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">https:\/\/bluefinsupboards.com\/special-offers\/<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">No dropshipping allowed!<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Clawbacks.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We will claw back commission based on<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">1. Cancelled Orders<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">2. Returns<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3. Fraudulent Transactions<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">4. Affiliate fraud.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5. Affiliates breaking terms and conditions.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">6. Orders attributed to another marketing channel&nbsp;<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">(last click)<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/bluefinsupboards.com\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=22382&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:38.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T10:44:47.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"bluefinsupboards.com"}}  
