ee UK delivery whenever you fill your box<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Planet BrewDog loyalty scheme<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Every order is carbon negative, the planets favourite beer.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Publisher Benefits:&nbsp;<\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">8% commission for&nbsp;new customers<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3% commission for&nbsp;exisitng customers<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">AOV of over \u00a350<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Conv Rate of over 7%<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Includes BrewDog Beers, Cider, Spirits and Merchandise<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We encourage publishers to promote us on their websites and social media accounts, but we don't currently allow PPC bidding.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Interested in becoming an affiliate?<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Simply email any enquiries to: affiliates@brewdog.com<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.brewdog.com\/eu_de","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=24585&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T10:56:40.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":1,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"brewdog.com"}}  
