kin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; display: table; width: 1210.89px;\"><div bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: table-row;\"><div class=\"labelCell heading2text\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; display: table-cell; width: 200px;\">Change Notification Period<\/div><div class=\"labelValue io_diff_line\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 26px; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; display: table-cell;\">The Contract can be changed or cancelled with 1 day(s) notification to the media partner.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"labelLine\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; display: table; width: 1210.89px;\"><div bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: table-row;\"><div class=\"labelCell heading2text\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; display: table-cell; width: 200px;\">Reversal Policy<\/div><div class=\"labelValue io_diff_line\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 26px; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; display: table-cell;\">Reversal of performance advertising actions are decided by the Advertiser governed by a max reversal percentage of 100%<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"labelLine\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; display: table; width: 1210.89px;\"><div bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: table-row;\"><div class=\"labelCell heading2text\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; display: table-cell; width: 200px;\">Custom Creative<\/div><div class=\"labelValue io_diff_line\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 26px; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; display: table-cell;\">Custom TV Radio creative, 800 numbers and shipping costs will be paid by Advertiser<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"labelLine\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; display: table; width: 1210.89px;\"><div bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: table-row;\"><div class=\"labelCell heading2text\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; display: table-cell; width: 200px;\">Media Partner Tracking Pixel<\/div><div class=\"labelValue io_diff_line\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 26px; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; display: table-cell;\">Advertiser does NOT allow media partner to fire their tracking pixel when the consumer action is completed.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"labelLine\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; display: table; width: 1210.89px;\"><div bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; display: table-row;\"><div class=\"labelCell heading2text\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 14px; display: table-cell; width: 200px;\">Affiliate Program Agreement ET<\/div><div class=\"labelValue io_diff_line\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; line-height: 26px; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; display: table-cell;\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Empire Today Affiliate Program Agreement<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This Empire Affiliate Program Agreement (\u201cAgreement\u201d) effective as of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">_________________<\/span>&nbsp;(\u201cEffective Date\u201d) provides terms and conditions applicable to your membership (as a Publisher, as defined below) in the Empire Affiliate Program (the \u201cProgram\u201d) that are in addition to any terms and conditions that you, the undersigned, as a Publisher (as defined below) may have agreed to pursuant to an agreement with an Empire Marketing Affiliate (hereafter defined).&nbsp; Empire (as defined below) and Publisher each acknowledge that they may be parties to agreements with \u201cMarketing Affiliates\u201d (e.g. Invoca; Yahoo; Google; Amazon, etc.) of Empire and may be participants in a Marketing Affiliate Network (\u201cNetwork\u201d).<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">BY SIGNING BELOW AND CONTINUING TO PARTICIPATE IN THE PROGRAM FOLLOWING OUR DELIVERY TO YOU (WHICH MAY BE BY EMAIL TO YOU AT YOUR EMAIL ADDRESS OF RECORD WITH EMPIRE TODAY) OF A CHANGE NOTICE, REVISED AGREEMENT, OR REVISED PROGRAM DOCUMENTATION, YOU, PUBLISHER, AGREE: (A) TO BE BOUND BY THIS AGREEMENT; (B) THAT YOU HAVE INDEPENDENTLY EVALUATED THE DESIRABILITY OF PARTICIPATING IN THE PROGRAM AND ARE NOT RELYING ON ANY REPRESENTATION, GUARANTEE, OR STATEMENT OTHER THAN AS EXPRESSLY SET FORTH IN THIS AGREEMENT; AND (C) REPRESENT AND WARRANT THAT YOU ARE LAWFULLY ABLE TO ENTER INTO CONTRACTS (e.g., YOU ARE NOT A MINOR) AND THAT YOU ARE AND WILL REMAIN IN COMPLIANCE WITH THIS AGREEMENT.&nbsp; IN ADDITION, IF THIS AGREEMENT IS BEING AGREED TO BY A COMPANY OR OTHER NON-PERSON LEGAL ENTITY, THEN THE PERSON AGREEING TO THIS AGREEMENT ON BEHALF OF THAT COMPANY OR ENTITY HEREBY REPRESENTS AND WARRANTS THAT HE OR SHE IS AUTHORIZED AND LAWFULLY ABLE TO BIND THAT COMPANY OR ENTITY TO THIS AGREEMENT.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Background<\/span>.&nbsp; Empire Today, LLC, a Delaware limited liability is in the business of providing installed home improvements and home furnishings, specifically carpet, hard surface flooring, and window treatments for residential and commercial applications.&nbsp; Empire Today, LLC together with its parent(s), subsidiaries and affiliates (collectively, \u201cEmpire\u201d), in connection with its website,&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.empiretoday.com\/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"outline: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(2, 95, 162);\">www.empiretoday.com<\/a>&nbsp;(the \u201cWebsite\u201d), other specific designated URLs or landing pages designated by Empire (each, a \u201cDestination Site\u201d), and\/or designated telephone numbers (each, a \u201cPhone Number\u201d), conducts the Program, through which approved companies (\u201cPublisher(s)\u201d) are granted a revocable, limited and non-exclusive right to:<\/p><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">lawfully advertise and promote Empire products and services and the Website solely in a manner approved by Empire and solely through Empire Today\u2019s Marketing Affiliates;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">RADIO AND TELEVISION: lawfully use approved advertisements in specifically-approved television and radio outlets to attract and funnel consumers to the Website, a Destination Site and\/or a Phone Number provided by Empire or its Marketing Affiliates;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">PRINT MEDIA: lawfully use approved advertisements in specifically-approved newspapers and other print media outlets to attract and funnel consumers to the Website, a Destination Site and\/or a Phone Number provided by Empire or its Marketing Affiliates;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">WEB MEDIA: lawfully use approved advertisements in specifically-approved types of Internet and on-line outlets and media to attract and funnel consumers to the Website, a Destination Site and\/or a Phone Number provided by Empire or its Marketing Affiliates;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">OUT-OF-HOME MEDIA: lawfully use approved advertisements in specifically-approved types of out-of-home outlets and media to attract and funnel consumers to the Website, a Destination Site and\/or a Phone Number provided by Empire or its Marketing Affiliates; and<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">Publishers are offered the opportunity to earn an \u201cAdvertising Fee\u201d (the Advertising Fee may be changed in Empire\u2019s sole discretion by delivery to you (which may be by email to your email address of record with Empire Today) of a different Advertising Fee or upon notice to Publishers) for each \u201cQualified Purchase\u201d (as defined below).<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Empire or its Marketing Affiliates may also make available technology (e.g., plug-ins, API, etc\u2026) that facilitate the placement of advertisements, or otherwise facilitate the Program.&nbsp; Any such technology may be subject to a separate license agreement and Publisher is solely responsible for accepting and complying with such license agreement(s).&nbsp; If Publisher rejects any such license agreement(s), Publisher may not use the related technology.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Publisher is solely responsible for the operation of Publisher\u2019s website(s) and other media and participation in the Program, including, without limitation, all expenses and legal compliance related to Publisher\u2019s website(s) and Publisher\u2019s participation in this Agreement and the Program.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Approvals<\/span>.&nbsp; All participation in the Program is subject to Empire Today\u2019s approval, which may be withheld in Empire Today\u2019s sole discretion.&nbsp; In addition, each approval is made on a website by website basis for those Publishers leveraging digital advertising for their approved traffic source and operating with more than one website, on a Network-by-Network basis for those Publishers participating in any Network (including, without limitation, any print-media Network), and on an outlet-by-outlet basis for those Publishers using print and out-of-home media and outlets.&nbsp; Publisher expressly agrees that it will not publish any advertisements in any media or outlets not specifically approved by Empire Today.&nbsp; Publisher must submit each outlet (e.g., the print outlet, out-of-home placement, the URL for each website, etc.) for which the Publisher is seeking approval, regardless of whether Publisher maintains a separate account on the Network for such Publisher website.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Unless notified to the contrary, in writing from Empire Today, all prospective Publishers must submit an application to Empire through one of its Marketing Affiliate(s) in order to become an \u201capproved\u201d Publisher eligible to participate in Program and earn Advertising Fees.&nbsp; If your application is rejected, you may reapply at any time.&nbsp; However, if Empire accepts your application and later determines that your site, methods, or placements are unsuitable, Empire may terminate this Agreement<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Empire will provide publisher with approved copy and art based on the specific needs and requirements of the Program.&nbsp; If Empire -provided information fits the submission requirements of the media outlet, then it should be used without change, except for the use of the correct Phone Number or URL for tracking purposes.&nbsp; If the provided copy and art needs altering, Publisher may produce media publication art in-house for print advertising (such as, but not limited to direct mail, newspaper and magazine advertising), mobile media and online media for participation in the Program.&nbsp; Publisher shall submit to Empire Today, for approval, in accordance with the time deadlines set by Empire line art and copy specifications for all advertisements (collectively, \u201cSubmissions\u201d, or individually, a \u201cSubmission\u201d), in accordance with all guidelines for advertisements as may be provided by Empire to Publisher from time-to-time.&nbsp; Publisher agrees to, and does hereby irrevocably assign to Empire Today, and Publisher shall cause its personnel to automatically and irrevocably assign to Empire Today, at the time of creation, without any requirement of further consideration, any and all right, title, or interest (including, without limitation, all copyright) it or they may have in Submissions.&nbsp; Upon approval by Empire Today, which approval may be granted or withheld by Empire in its sole discretion, a Submission will be an \u201cApproved Advertisement.\u201d&nbsp; Publisher may make non-material changes to approved artwork, solely for purposes of conforming approved advertisements to space requirements, provided that Empire may revoke approval for any advertisement modified by Publisher and Publisher agrees to promptly take all steps necessary, at Publisher\u2019s expense, to remove any such advertisement and to replace such advertisement with Empire-approved artwork.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Unless notified to the contrary, Empire will notify each prospective Publisher through the Marketing Affiliate(s) in writing (by e-mail or otherwise) whether or not it has been approved.&nbsp; Publisher is not authorized to participate in Program until approved in advance by Empire Today.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By participating in the Program, Publisher agrees to comply with all Program requirements and all pages, schedules, policies, guidelines, and other documents and materials referenced in this Agreement and otherwise provided to Publisher by Empire (collectively, \u201cProgram Documentation\u201d)<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Limited Right to Use Empire Marks<\/span>.&nbsp; Upon Publisher\u2019s receipt of a written notice of approval as a Publisher, Empire grants to Publisher a limited, revocable, non-transferable, non-exclusive license during the term of this Agreement to use (in the United States) only those Empire marks, trademarks, service marks, trade names, trade dress, logos, graphics and icons specifically designated and provided by Empire (\u201cMarks\u201d) solely in connection with the approved placement of Approved Advertisements as posted on the Publisher\u2019s website or in the Publisher\u2019s Network, and solely in connection with the Links and\/or Phone Numbers to the Destination Site.&nbsp; This license may be immediately terminated upon notice from Empire and shall automatically and immediately terminate upon any termination or expiration of this Agreement.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Publisher\u2019s use of the Marks will at all times be subject to the prior written approval of Empire and Publisher shall comply with all reasonable guidelines provided by Empire with respect to the graphic reproduction and appearance of the Marks and the \u201clook and feel\u201d related to the marketing and representation of Empire and its products and services in any advertisements.&nbsp; Publisher\u2019s use of the Marks shall include the appropriate trademark\/service mark symbols and Publisher shall not remove such symbols.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Nothing in the Agreement gives Publisher any right, title or interest in the \u201cEmpire Today\u00ae\u201d logo or mark, or any other Empire owned marks.&nbsp; Empire reserves all rights, title and interest in the Marks and the goodwill associated with use of the Marks shall inure solely to the benefit of Empire Today.&nbsp; Publisher acknowledges Empire rights in and to the Marks and that any use by Publisher of Marks will inure to the sole benefit of Empire Today.&nbsp; All rights not expressly granted in this Agreement are reserved by Empire Today.&nbsp; Publisher\u2019s right to use the Marks is limited to and arises only out of the license granted hereunder and Publisher will make no other use of the Marks.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Publisher shall not assert the invalidity, unenforceability, or contest the ownership by Empire of the Marks in any action or proceeding of whatever kind or nature, and shall not take any action that may prejudice Empire Today\u2019s right, title or interest in the Marks, render the same generic, or otherwise damage or tarnish the Marks, or diminish their associated goodwill.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Publisher agrees not to register or attempt to register any phrases, marks or logos that would cause confusion, or be likely to cause confusion, with, or be a translation or transliteration of, any of the Marks.&nbsp; Publisher also agrees that it will not disparage Empire Today, its subsidiaries, products, or services or otherwise damage Empire goodwill in the Marks.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The limited right to use the Marks solely in Approved Advertisements in accordance with the Program as set forth in this Section 3 will immediately and automatically terminate if at any time Publisher does not comply with this Agreement or any Program Documentation, or otherwise upon termination of this Agreement.&nbsp; Empire may terminate the license set forth in this Section 3 in whole or in part upon written notice to Publisher.&nbsp; Publisher will promptly remove from Publisher\u2019s site and delete or otherwise destroy all Approved Advertisements and Marks with respect to which the rights set forth in this Section 3 are terminated or as Empire may otherwise request from time to time.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Usage of Marks<\/span>.&nbsp; Empire requires that Publisher obtain original digital or camera-ready artwork directly from Empire or an Empire Marketing Affiliate.&nbsp; No alterations, modifications, cropping or additions to the Marks or any Empire Today-approved artwork are permitted.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The Marks may only be displayed in the colors as provided by Empire and only in Approved Advertisements.&nbsp; Black and white can only be used in approved materials that are less than 4-color.&nbsp; The typeface for the Marks will only be the typeface supplied by Empire Today. &nbsp;Any colors, fonts, images or graphics that are used in materials that visually display the Marks should reflect those same brand attributes without copying the overall Empire trade dress or other Empire created materials.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The Marks should always have the \u201c\u00ae\u201d registered mark symbol, \u201cTM\u201d trademark symbol, or \u201cSM\u201d service mark symbol near the upper right corner of the applicable mark, as designated by Empire Today.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The \u201cEMPIRE TODAY<span style=\"vertical-align: text-top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00ae<\/span>\u201d mark may not be violated or touched by any other text or graphics in any way and there must be a reasonable border of space on all sides in every instance in which the \u201cEMPIRE TODAY<span style=\"vertical-align: text-top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00ae<\/span>\u201d mark appears.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In Empire Today\u2019s review of Publisher\u2019s marketing materials, Empire may provide input about whether said materials or displays conform to the brand character.&nbsp; If Submissions are, in the sole opinion of Empire Today, inconsistent with Empire Today\u2019s brand character, Empire can require that such materials be changed prior to granting any approval as set forth in the Agreement.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The \u201cEMPIRE TODAY<span style=\"vertical-align: text-top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00ae<\/span>\u201d mark is a registered mark of Empire and must appear with the&nbsp;<span style=\"vertical-align: text-top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00ae<\/span>&nbsp;symbol placed on the right \u201cshoulder\u201d of the mark.&nbsp; Thus, the correct symbol placement generally is as follows: \u201cEMPIRE TODAY<span style=\"vertical-align: text-top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;\u00ae<\/span>.\u201d&nbsp; The symbol must appear in every iteration of the mark in logo form, but may be omitted after the first mention in prose\/plain-text materials.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In addition to the above, the appropriate ownership legend must be included in the \u201clegal notices\u201d section of any materials in which the \u201cEMPIRE TODAY<span style=\"vertical-align: text-top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00ae<\/span>\u201d logo or mark is displayed.&nbsp; This legend must read generally as follows: \u201cEmpire Today<span style=\"vertical-align: text-top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00ae<\/span>&nbsp;is a registered mark of Empire Today, LLC.\u201d In advertising and promotional materials, the legend is typically placed at the bottom of the ad or layout. The legend may appear in small type, but must be legible in all instances.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Publisher should attempt to use the \u201cEMPIRE TODAY<span style=\"vertical-align: text-top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00ae<\/span>\u201d mark as an adjective (e.g., \u201cEMPIRE TODAY<span style=\"vertical-align: text-top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00ae<\/span>&nbsp;service\u201d).&nbsp; Permission to use the Marks is subject to prior written approval by an authorized representative of Empire as to each of Publisher\u2019s uses.&nbsp; Publisher agrees to use only Approved Advertisements, and only in accordance with the terms of this Agreement and the Program Documentation.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Empire reserves the right to object to unfair uses or misuses of the Marks or other violations of applicable law.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Limited License to Link to Empire Web Site and Promote Calls to the Phone Numbers<\/span>.&nbsp; If, and only if, Empire has specifically approved Publisher for Internet and on-line marketing in connection with the Program, Publisher may lawfully direct visitors from the Publisher\u2019s website or a website within an Empire Today-approved Network to a specific URL or landing page designated by Empire Today.&nbsp; Upon receiving a written notice of approval to be a Publisher and approval of Internet and on-line Approved Advertisements, Empire hereby grants Publisher a limited, revocable, non-transferable, non-exclusive license during the term of this Agreement to post on each of Publisher\u2019s websites and in Networks that have been approved by Empire in advance, approved graphical or textual Internet hyper-links (each, a \u201cLink\u201d) and\/or Phone Numbers (only as approved by Empire within an Approved Advertisement) to Empire and its Marketing Partner\u2019s Phone Numbers and\/or to a destination website (the \u201cDestination Site\u201d) and to direct visitors to the Destination Site in accordance with the terms and conditions of this Agreement.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Publisher\u2019s use of the Links and\/or Phone Numbers must only be as approved by Empire within an Approved Advertisement and must comply with the following:<\/p><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">Phone Numbers used must be those provided by Empire or its approved Marketing Affiliate(s).&nbsp; Any phone transfer process may only be as approved by Empire and will be designed to minimize delay for consumers calling these Phone Numbers and their ability to get an appointment with Empire Today.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">Links between the Publisher\u2019s website and the Destination Site must be a direct link (e.g., no interstitials, pop-up windows or redirects);<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">Links between the Publisher\u2019s website and the Destination Site may not be framed or co-branded by Publisher;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">Links between the Publisher\u2019s website and the Destination Site may not contain any trojan horses, spyware, worms, time bombs, viruses or other harmful programming routines; and<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">Links must incorporate a unique \u201ctag\u201d provided by Empire Today, and Phone Numbers provided by Empire or Marketing Affiliates must be used in the form provided, in order to permit accurate tracking, reporting and credit for Advertising Fee payments.&nbsp; Publisher must ensure that each of the Links between its website and the Destination Site properly utilize the Empire Today-designated tagged link format.&nbsp; Publishers will only earn Advertising Fees with respect to activity on the Destination Site occurring directly through a tagged Links or Qualified Purchases made through phone orders received using the Phone Numbers.&nbsp; Empire will not be liable to pay Publisher for Qualified Purchases that are received from untagged Links or at any phone number other than the Phone Numbers.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">If applicable, Publisher agrees to use&nbsp; verify and document compliance consent with all applicable laws, rules and regulations, including, but not limited to TCPA and CASL, and in such event, maintain evidence of the &nbsp;name, date\/ time stamp, IP address, telephone number (mobile), email address, opt-in to offer, and consent to call using an auto-dialer and SMS text messaging.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">Publisher represents and warrants tha Publisher makes no outbound calls, and if an to the extent Publisher so does, shall maintain and and all documentation including \"prior express written consent to be called via an \"automatic telephone dialing system,\" as those terms are defined in 47 CFR 64.1200(f), by or on behalf of EMPIRE, and Publisher will indemnify, defend and hold harmless Empire for any Publisher breach of this representation and warranty.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">6.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Advertising Restrictions<\/span>.&nbsp; Any Publisher website or other media used to place Links or Approved Advertisements or otherwise participate in the Program must have bona fide content and must not be false or misleading.&nbsp; Without limiting any other restrictions on use of the Marks, Publisher agrees that they will not use or employ domain names which are similar to the Marks, the Destination Site or to the Website in order to obtain data submissions (e.g., domain names based on misnomers, pseudonyms, misspellings, typos and similar phonics) or incorporate any of the Marks as metatags on any web pages.&nbsp; Publisher also agrees to not use search engine placements (e.g. purchase of key terms) that are based on the Marks, or domain names based on misnomers, pseudonyms, misspellings, typos or similar phonics relating to the Marks or any Empire websites.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Under the Program, Publisher shall not:<\/p><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">have any authority to make or publish any statement, claims, representation or warranty about Empire products or services, which could be deemed to be a binding offer, obligation or guarantee by Empire (other than as expressly authorized in advance and in writing by Empire Today);<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">misrepresent the services provided by Empire or the services offered by the Website;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">imply any type of affiliation or relationship with Empire Today, other than that of advertiser;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">assist or attempt to assist Empire in the procurement or origination of purchases arising from visitors to or Links from the Publisher\u2019s website;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">solicit visitors by direct mail, email or by telemarketing;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">solicit visitors by pop-up or pop-under advertisements on any website;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">provide cash, points, gifts or any other consideration or incentive to entice visitors to complete an action on the Destination Site;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc;\">advertise Empire on, or in connection with, any website or other publication that promotes or contains: sexually explicit materials, infringing materials, violent materials, defamatory or libelous materials; discriminatory (whether based on race, sex, religion, nationality, disability, sexual orientation, age, or otherwise) materials, or illegal activities or materials.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">7.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Qualified Purchases and Advertising Fees<\/span>.&nbsp; Empire reserves the right to cap the maximum number of Qualified Purchases that it will receive from Publisher in a single calendar day.&nbsp; Empire reserves the right to adjust the cap at any time and such adjustments may be communica