nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Healthy chef-made meals delivered, new menu every week<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">A variety of meal plans on offer<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Note: websites listing all available Chefgood coupons won't be accepted, transactions with unknown affiliate traffic source will be voided (exceptions can be made for specific affiliates)<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Work with us today and spread the Chefgood experience! We look forward to working with you!<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>- Chefgood Team<\/b><\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Attractive $15&nbsp; commission for new customers<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">0 commission for orders including a referral offer<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 day tracking cookie period<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Mobile optimised website<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Open to custom marketing collaborations<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Ongoing promotions for new customers&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Healthy chef-made meals delivered, new menu every week<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">A variety of meal plans on offer<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Note: transactions with unknown affiliate traffic source will be voided (exceptions can be made for specific affiliates).<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/chefgood.com.au\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=41528&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-05-07T19:09:11.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-04T09:09:39.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"chefgood.com.au"}}  
