lanet. We are seeking motivated and engaged individuals to promote our products and philosophy to their communities to make a difference in this world.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">NAYA DE Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>ENGLISH<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">YOUR EVERYDAY SKINCARE SORTED! GOOD FOR YOU. GOOD FOR THE PLANET.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">All our products are enriched with&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">authentic<\/span>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">consciously<\/span>&nbsp;grown Cacay Oil. We use&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">regenerative<\/span>&nbsp;farming methods to&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">ethically&nbsp;<\/span>source our ingredients, which we then combine with&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">clinically proven COSMOS certified&nbsp;<\/span>actives to create our&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">100% vegan, essential oil free<\/span>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">award-winning<\/span>&nbsp;formulations. The result? Pure, yet efficacious products that are sustainable for both your skin and the environment.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We consciously use&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">upcycled<\/span>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">biodegradable<\/span>&nbsp;materials throughout our supply chain to reduce waste and plastic. And we ship worldwide in a climate-neutral way.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">When you buy from us, you support our&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">regenerative project<\/span>&nbsp;- Tierra Radiante - and give back to the&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">indigenous communities<\/span>&nbsp;in Columbia and support other social &amp; environmental projects with&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">EDEN Reforestation<\/span>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Four Seasons.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The brand\u2019s star ingredient - Cacay Oil - is sustainably sourced from the Amazon in Columbia. NAYA works directly with the farmers involved in harvesting the oil, to protect and cultivate 30-50 hectares within the rainforest. NAYA has recently launched its \u2018Tierra Radiante \u2013 Roots to Glow\u2019 project where the harvesters grow cacay and indigenous plants from the area to replace those used within the product formulations.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The entire range is housed in glass bottles, using stone-flour labels and all other materials are fully recyclable. Each product is vegan, cruelty and toxic-free.<\/p><blockquote style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u201cOur approach to skincare goes beyond our products. We work closely with farmers and other partners across the globe to establish good practices that will deliver the purest ingredients to nourish your skin, feed your soul and calm your mind. we want to have a positive impact on the world, including our customers, our suppliers, the environment and the local and global economy\u201d Sarah Zimmer, Founder of NAYA<\/p><\/blockquote><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Cacay Oil has a myriad of benefits for the skin:<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Naturally derived retinol helps to increase cell turnover and improve skin tone.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Vitamin E protects the skin against free radicals and prevents premature ageing.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Essential fatty acids help to balance sebum production.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Linoleic acid strengthens the natural skin barrier and promotes the formation of healthy new skin cells.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In an independent clinical trial in 2018, studies showed that Cacay Oil (10%) improved skin surface hydration in 100% of participants. Clinical studies have also proven its effectiveness in combating signs of ageing; 95% of patients showed a reduction of wrinkles by up to 45% after 4 weeks of use.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We are 100% vegan. Up to 99% natural. Up to 70% Organic. And using 0% fragrances \/ essential oils.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>GERMAN<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">DEINE EVERYDAY HAUTPFLEGE, DIE GUT F\u00dcR DICH UND F\u00dcR DIE UMWELT IST.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Alle unsere Produkte sind angereichert mit&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">reinem<\/span>&nbsp;und&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">nachhaltig<\/span>&nbsp;angebautem Cacay \u00d6l. Wir nutzen&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">regenerative<\/span>&nbsp;Anbaumethoden, um&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">nachhaltig<\/span>&nbsp;unsere Inhaltsstoffe zu gewinnen, die wir dann mit&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">klinisch erprobten&nbsp;<\/span>Wirkstoffen kombinieren, um unsere&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">veganen<\/span>, ohne \u00e4therischen \u00d6len und Alkohol,&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">preisgekr\u00f6nten<\/span>&nbsp;Rezepturen zu entwickeln. Das Ergebnis? Reine, aber dennoch wirksame Produkte, die sowohl f\u00fcr deine Haut als auch f\u00fcr die Umwelt nachhaltig sind.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Wir verwenden bewusst&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">upcycled<\/span>&nbsp;und&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">biologisch abbaubare<\/span>&nbsp;Materialien in unserer gesamten Lieferkette, um Abfall und Plastik zu reduzieren.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Wenn du bei uns kaufst, unterst\u00fctzt du unser&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">regeneratives Projekt<\/span>&nbsp;- Tierra Radiante - und gibst den&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">indigenen Gemeinschaften<\/span>&nbsp;in Kolumbien etwas zur\u00fcck.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Der Hauptwirkstoff der Marke - Cacay-\u00d6l - wird nachhaltig aus dem Amazonasgebiet in Kolumbien gewonnen. NAYA arbeitet direkt mit den Bauern zusammen, die an der Ernte des \u00d6ls beteiligt sind, um 30-50 Hektar des Regenwaldes zu sch\u00fctzen und zu kultivieren. NAYA hat vor kurzem das Projekt \"Tierra Radiante - Roots to Glow\" ins Leben gerufen, bei dem die Bauern Cacay und einheimische Pflanzen aus der Region anbauen, um die f\u00fcr die Produktformulierungen verwendeten Pflanzen zu ersetzen.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Das gesamte Sortiment ist in Glasflaschen abgef\u00fcllt und alle anderen Materialien sind vollst\u00e4ndig recycelbar. Jedes Produkt ist vegan, frei von Grausamkeiten und Giftstoffen.<\/p><blockquote style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\"Unser Ansatz zur Hautpflege geht \u00fcber unsere Produkte hinaus. Wir arbeiten eng mit Landwirten und anderen Partnern auf der ganzen Welt zusammen, um gute Praktiken zu etablieren, die die reinsten Inhaltsstoffe liefern, um Ihre Haut zu n\u00e4hren, Ihre Seele zu n\u00e4hren und Ihren Geist zu beruhigen. Wir wollen einen positiven Einfluss auf die Welt haben, einschlie\u00dflich unserer Kunden, unserer Lieferanten, der Umwelt und der lokalen und globalen Wirtschaft\" Sarah Zimmer, Gr\u00fcnderin von NAYA<\/p><\/blockquote><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Cacay-\u00d6l hat eine Vielzahl von Vorteilen f\u00fcr die Haut:<\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Nat\u00fcrlich gewonnenes Retinol hilft, den Zellumsatz zu erh\u00f6hen und den Hautton zu verbessern.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Vitamin E sch\u00fctzt die Haut vor freien Radikalen und beugt vorzeitiger Hautalterung vor.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Essentielle Fetts\u00e4uren helfen, die Talgproduktion auszugleichen.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Linols\u00e4ure st\u00e4rkt die nat\u00fcrliche Hautbarriere und f\u00f6rdert die Bildung von gesunden neuen Hautzellen.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In einer unabh\u00e4ngigen klinischen Studie aus dem Jahr 2018 zeigten Studien, dass Cacay-\u00d6l (10 %) die Hautoberfl\u00e4chenfeuchtigkeit bei 100 % der Teilnehmer verbesserte. Klinische Studien haben auch seine Wirksamkeit bei der Bek\u00e4mpfung von Anzeichen der Hautalterung bewiesen; 95 % der Patienten zeigten eine Verringerung der Falten um bis zu 45 % nach 4 Wochen Anwendung.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Wir sind 100% vegan. Bis zu 99% nat\u00fcrlich. Bis zu 70% biologisch. Und verwenden 0% Duftstoffe \/ \u00e4therische \u00d6le.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">1.1 In these terms and conditions unless the context indicates otherwise, the following words and expressions shall have the following meaning:<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cAgreement\u201d shall mean the terms and conditions set out in this document and shall also apply to all Notices, the Income Potential, Ambassador Registration Form, Ambassador Handbook and where the Ambassador is a Team Leader\/ Manager, the Manager Handbook incorporating the Naya Skincare Ltd business opportunity amended from time to time. In the case of a conflict between the terms of this Agreement and any other document, the terms of this Agreement shall apply; \u201cNaya\u201d shall mean Naya Skincare Ltd, a company registered in England and Wales, Company registration number 11091163 registered office at Kemp House, 152-160 City Road, London, EC1V 2NX, UK, VAT Number 284 9404 71, trading as Naya Skincare Ltd;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cAffiliate\u201d shall mean any person appointed by Naya as an Ambassador and whose appointment has not been terminated;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cManager\u201d shall mean an Ambassador who, in compliance with this Agreement, has been promoted by Naya to the status of self-employed manager (in accordance with the rules defined in the Success Plan);<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cProducts\u201d shall mean all products supplied by Naya, the details of which are contained in the Naya Skincare Ltd List and on the Naya Skincare Ltd website, and\/or produced by Naya and which may be varied from time to time by Naya under its absolute discretion;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cApproved Venue\u201d shall mean any private residential premises or such other premises, exhibition venue or websites in the Territory as may be approved by Naya in writing from time to time;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cPolicies and Procedures: Where to Sell\u201d shall mean the guidelines provided by Naya and which contains certain information, policies, procedures and best practices in relation to any private residential premises or such other premises, exhibition venues or websites in the Territory as may be approved by Naya from time to time;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cSocial Media and Online Content Guidelines\u201d shall mean the guidelines provided by Naya for all online Ambassador activity;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cDesign Guidelines\u201d shall mean the guidelines provided by Naya for all self-printed marketing and advertising activity;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cSuccess Plan\u201d shall mean the document provided by Naya and which contains information and definitions concerning the financial rewards for Ambassadors when Direct Sales or E-Commerce Sales are made and\/or when title promotions are achieved;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cCustomer\u201d shall mean any consumer or end user of the Products and shall not, for the avoidance of doubt, include any person intending to resell the Products;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cDirect Sale\u201d shall mean the sale of the Product by the Ambassador direct to a Customer whether at a Pamper Experience or otherwise;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cE-commerce Sale\u201d shall mean a sale of a Product, including but not limited to an E-commerce Sale, made by Naya to a Customer direct where the Customer was originally introduced to Naya by the Ambassador, and where such a sale takes place by the Customer placing an order for Products directly to Naya;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cHost\u201d shall mean a person who arranges a Pamper Experience at an Approved Venue (whether the person is the Ambassador themselves, a Customer or any other person);<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cIncome Potential\u201d shall mean the provisions of the Success Plan concerning the financial rewards for Ambassadors when Direct Sales or E-Commerce Sales are made;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cKit\u201d or \u201cStarter Kit\u201d shall mean a selection of Products, sales, marketing, training aids and business stationery used by the Ambassador in their business and supplied to the Ambassador by Naya;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cAuthorised Officer\u201d shall mean an employee of Naya who has authorisation to make the necessary decisions;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cNotice\u201d shall mean a notice of amendment made by Naya;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cSales and Marketing Products\u201d shall mean the literature and marketing tools provided to the Ambassador and\/or Manager by Naya to assist with the marketing and sales process when carrying out their business, where applicable, but not for sale to Customers;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cTerritory\u201d shall mean England, Scotland, Wales, Northern Ireland, Channel Islands, Germany the Ambassador Personal Shop Website, Pamper Experience, Salons, Shows\/Fairs;<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\u201cTrading Scheme\u201d shall mean a regulated trading scheme to which part XI of the Fair Trading Act 1973 (as amended) applies; Note, the headings used in these terms and conditions.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">A reference to writing or written articles, including faxes and e-mails.<\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">1.3 Unless the context otherwise indicates, a reference to one gender shall include a reference&nbsp; to the other genders.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3. AFFILIATE TERMS AND CONDITIONS FINANCIAL AND OTHER OBLIGATIONS OF THE AFFILIATE<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3.1 The affiliate&nbsp;is an independent, self-employed contractor and this Agreement does not create a franchise or an employer\/employee, agency, partnership, or joint venture relationship. Subject to condition 4.1 below, during the term of this Agreement, the affiliate shall be responsible for all costs and expenses the Affiliate incurs as a result of their affiliate business for Naya, including but not limited to those relating to travel, accommodation, any business stationery and the purchase of any goods or services.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3.2 No Affiliate&nbsp;is obliged for any reason, during the term of this Agreement to:<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">purchase from Naya or any other third Party any specified amount or value of Products and Sales and Marketing Products, or other goods or services;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">maintain a specified minimum inventory of Sales and Marketing Product;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">purchase tickets to attend rallies, seminars or other meetings held by Naya or any other third party;<\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">the Ambassador expressly acknowledges by agreeing to this Agreement that Naya has not advised the Ambassador to do so.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5. TAX AND INSURANCE<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The Affiliate attention is drawn in particular to the provisions of conditions 5.3 and 5.4.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5.1 In the event that the Affiliate is or becomes VAT registered and is required to charge Naya VAT on payments due under the Income Potential, the Affiliate agrees to notify Naya immediately that they are VAT registered. In the event that Naya is required to pay VAT on any payment due to the Affiliate under the Income Potential or otherwise, the Affiliate and Naya agree for Naya to self-bill for such sums and the Ambassador agrees that they will accept all self-billed invoices issued by Naya during the term of the Affiliate Agreement. VAT-registered Affiliate must notify Naya immediately in the event that they become deregistered.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">VAT-registered Ambassadors must notify Naya immediately in the event that they sell part or all of their business. VAT-registered Affiliate and Naya agree to notify the other party immediately in the event that they change their VAT registration number.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5.2 If Naya is obliged or liable to make any payment of VAT to the tax authorities as a result of the failure of the Affiliate to notify Naya of de-registration for VAT then the Affiliate acknowledges and agrees that Naya shall be entitled to recover from the Affiliate the amount of such VAT by making an equitable deduction from the Affiliate account with Naya, or by any other means available to Naya, from time to time.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5.3 Naya maintains and is covered by product and public liability insurance with a reputable insurance company for its own benefit.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5.4 Any information provided by Naya to an Affiliate in respect of Naya\u2019s insurance cover is for information purposes only and Naya in no way makes any representations or warranties in respect of insurance cover. The Affiliate is advised to seek their own independent advice from a qualified adviser as to their own insurance requirements.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">6. AMBASSADOR BEHAVIOUR<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">6.1&nbsp;The Affiliate shall not make any promises or representations to Customers or potential Customers nor give any guarantees or warranties in relation to any Products and Sales and Marketing Products nor shall the Affiliate admit any liability or attempt to settle any Customer claims with respect to the Products and Sales and Marketing Products on behalf of Naya. The Affiliate shall, where possible, deal with any Customer queries, complaints, exchanges and refunds by aligning and agreeing with Naya. Otherwise, the Affiliate shall refer all enquiries, comments and complaints relating to the Products and Sales and Marketing Products to Naya. In any event, where a Customer complaint relates to the quality of the Products and Sales and Marketing Products, the Affiliate shall immediately notify Naya of the same.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">6.3 The Affiliate hereby agrees to comply with all laws and statutory legislation and rules relating to the Affiliate's consultancy business and will not, in performing their obligations, put themselves or Naya in breach of any law. The Affiliate will, absolutely as required, make appropriate returns to the relevant authorities and, where applicable, pay all amounts due for income tax, national insurance and VAT and any other applicable taxes directly to the appropriate authorities.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">6.4 The Affiliate acknowledges that they are a \u201cbrand representative\u201d for Naya and as such will not use the name of Naya, or its logos or any of its trademarks, Products or trade names or designs other than for the purpose of exercising their rights and performing their obligations under the Agreement and furthermore shall not use the same in any way that might may prejudice their distinctiveness or validity or the goodwill of Naya therein.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">6.5&nbsp;The Affiliate agrees at all times to conduct their business ethically and in particular agrees that they will: (a) not use misleading, deceptive, unfair or inappropriate sales techniques; (b) respect the Customers\u2019 right of privacy and respect their contractual rights allowing any contract to be ended; (c) describe the Naya products honestly and accurately; (d) answer Customers\u2019 questions honestly and clearly; (e) give clear, concise and accurate information about the price of Products, delivery and the returns procedures; and (f) abide by all statutory rules and legislation regarding the promoting and selling of products. Where the Affiliate organises Pamper Experience, they will ensure that all invitations: (g) specify the purpose of the Pamper Experience; (h) explain that those invited are under no obligation to purchase anything. Furthermore, invitees shall be given details of a named contact person and telephone number or email address. The Affiliate agrees at all times when promoting Naya, its products and its business, to: (i) identify themselves as a Naya Affiliate clearly to potential Customers; (j) explain the reason for their approach; (k) identify and explain Naya and the Naya Products; (l) not represent themselves as an agent of Naya for any non-Naya-agreed purpose; (m) not pledge Naya\u2019s credit; (n) not give any condition or warranty on Naya\u2019s behalf; (o) not make any representation on Naya\u2019s behalf; (p) not commit Naya to any contracts.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">7 INDEMNITY<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">7.1 If the Affiliate fails to comply with any of their obligations under this Agreement, they shall indemnify Naya from and against any losses, costs, expenses, charges and\/or liabilities (whether civil or criminal) incurred as a result of such failure.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">9. DELIVERY AND PAYMENT<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">9.1. Naya shall be under no obligation to the Ambassador or any other person to release any Products and Sales and Marketing Products for delivery to the Ambassador or any other person unless and until Naya has received payment in full for the same.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">9.2&nbsp;Naya will use all reasonable endeavours to deliver within five (5) business days of receipt of payment, with the title of goods passing on delivery.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">9.3&nbsp;The commission is only valid when a customer buys a full-prized item and is not valid on any promotions.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">12 FRAUD<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">12.1 In the event an Affiliate has been found to have acted fraudulently, Naya shall have the right to cancel the Affiliate Agreement and also to reclaim any amounts paid by Naya that it deems reasonable.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">13 TERM AND RENEWAL<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">13.1 This Agreement shall commence on the date of execution hereof and will continue until terminated pursuant to the termination provisions set out below.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">14&nbsp;RETURN OF PRODUCTS AND SALES AND MARKETING PRODUCTS<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">14.1 If customer was acquired through an Affiliate, and customer returns items, the Affiliate will not receive payment for this item.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">15&nbsp;MISCELLANEOUS<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">15.1 Naya may assign this Agreement or any of its rights and obligations hereunder.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">15.2&nbsp;If any of the terms and conditions of this Agreement shall be found to be illegal, invalid or unenforceable under any applicable law, the invalidity of such term shall in no way effect the legality, validity or enforceability of any other term or condition of this Agreement, all of which shall remain in full force and effect.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">15.3&nbsp;This Agreement (except in the event of fraud) constitutes the entire agreement between Naya and the Affiliate and supersedes any previous agreement between them relating to the subject matter of this Agreement.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">15.4&nbsp;No person who is not a party to this Agreement may enforce any terms of this Agreement under the Contracts (Rights of Third party\u2019s) Act 1999.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">15.5&nbsp;Naya shall be under no obligation to the Affiliate, or any other person to release any Products to the Affiliate or any other person unless and until Naya has received full payment for the same.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">15.6&nbsp;The termination of this Agreement shall not of itself make Naya liable to pay any compensation to the Affiliate, including for loss of profits or goodwill.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">15.7&nbsp;Naya shall not be liable for any delay or for the consequences of any delay in performing its obligations under this Agreement if such delay is due to any cause whatsoever beyond its reasonable control, and Naya shall be entitled to a reasonable extension of the time for performing such obligations.<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.nayaglow.com\/de","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=25517&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:06:00.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:42:48.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"nayaglow.com"}}  
