\u00f6sung findet, die zu ihm passt.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Vorteil:<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: inside;\">10% auf Warenkorbwert f\u00fcr Publisher<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Dieses Tool kann verwendet werden, um Publishern eine Provision abh\u00e4ngig vom Warenkorbwert zu zahlen.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Definitions:<\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">In these Terms and Conditions, the terms \u201cCompany\u201d refer to your company and \u201cAffiliate\u201d refer to participants in your affiliate program.<\/font><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Agreement to Terms and Conditions:<\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">By participating in the Affiliate Program, the Affiliate agrees to accept and comply with these Terms a