eft: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">9.2<\/span><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Gift vouchers and remaining balance of gift vouchers can be redeemed until the end of the third year following the year in which the voucher was purchased.&nbsp;<\/font><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">Remaining credit will be credited to the customer until the expiry date.<\/font><\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">9.3<\/span><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Gift vouchers can only be redeemed before completing the ordering process.&nbsp;<\/font><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">Subsequent billing is not possible.<\/font><\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">9.4<\/span><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Multiple gift vouchers can also be redeemed with one order.<\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12p