er is entitled, but not obliged, to check the material eligibility of the respective voucher holder.<\/font><\/font><\/p><p><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: inherit;\">10) APPLICABLE LAW<\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">The law of the Federal Republic of Germany applies to all legal relationships between the parties, excluding the laws on the international purchase of movable goods.&nbsp;<\/font><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">For consumers, this choice of law only applies to the extent that the protection granted is not withdrawn by mandatory provisions of the law of the country in which the consumer has his or her habitual residence.<\/font><\/font><\/p><p><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: inherit;\">11) JURISDICTION<\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">If the customer acts as a merchant, a legal entity under public law or a special fund under public law based in the Federal Republic of Germany, the exclusive place of jurisdiction for all disputes arising from this contract is the seller's place of business.&nbsp;<\/font><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">If the customer is based outside the territory of the Federal Republic of Germany, the seller's place of business is the exclusive place of jurisdiction for all disputes arising from this contract if the contract or claims arising from the contract can be attributed to the customer's professional or commercial activity.&nbsp;<\/font><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">In the above cases, however, the seller is in any case entitled to appeal to the court at the customer's registered office.<\/font><\/font><\/p><p><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: inherit;\">12) CODE OF CONDUCT<\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">- The seller has agreed to the terms and conditions of participation for the eCommerce initiative \u201cFairness in Commerce\u201d, which can be viewed on the Internet at&nbsp;<\/font><a href=\"https:\/\/www.fairness-im-handel.de\/teilnahmebedingungen\/\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(255, 102, 0); cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">https:\/\/www.fairness-im-handel.de\/teilnahmebedingungen\/<\/a><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;.<\/font><\/p><p><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: inherit;\">13) ALTERNATIVE DISPUTE RESOLUTION<\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">13.1<\/span><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;The EU Commission provides a platform for online dispute resolution on the Internet at the following link:&nbsp;<\/font><a href=\"https:\/\/ec.europa.eu\/consumers\/odr\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(255, 102, 0); cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">https:\/\/ec.europa.eu\/consumers\/odr<\/a><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">This platform serves as a contact point for the out-of-court settlement of disputes arising from online purchase or service contracts in which a consumer is involved.<\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">13.2<\/span><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;The seller is not obliged to take part in a dispute resolution procedure before a consumer arbitration board, but is willing to do so.<\/font><\/p>","url":"https:\/\/bbq-rescher.de","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=64196&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-10-03T19:28:59.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:45:37.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"bbq-rescher.de"}}  
