o better gut health with award-winning Bimuno\u00ae today. Bimuno is a daily prebiotic supplement which feeds & stimulates the growth of good bacteria in your gut, in just 7 days!","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Bimuno Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Gut Health&nbsp;Made&nbsp;Simple<\/span>!<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Bimuno is a unique, high in fibre, prebiotic* gut health supplement, containing galacto-oligosaccharides. When taken daily it has been scientifically proven to naturally feed and stimulate the growth of beneficial bacteria in the large intestine (gut), and support the balance of your microbiome, within just 7 days** &nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">It\u2019s easy to take \u2013 just add the taste-free powder can simply be added to hot or cold drinks or even stirred into food.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Supported by science<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The Bimuno range of prebiotic supplements has been created through an extensive scientific research programme that started with the University of Reading back in 2007.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Since then, it\u2019s become one of the most widely studied prebiotics of its kind and is supported by over 100 scientific publications. Bimuno has been developed to specifically target and nourish bifidobacteria, a type of good gut bacteria that produces vitamins and supports health.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">*Unaffected by stomach acid and enzymes therefore remains intact through your digestive system<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">**Scientific data shows that daily use of Bimuno increases bifidobacterial levels within 7 days, results may vary.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Why join the Bimuno Affiliate Program?<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Bimuno Daily can be purchased through a 3-month subscription or one-off 30-day packs. We incentivise customers purchasing subscription plans by offering competitive discounts, exclusive member competitions, giveaways, and delicious recipes.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We ship worldwide and offer several choices of service that\u2019s trusted by thousands. Free UK Delivery when you subscribe for orders above \u00a325 or a 7-15 Working Day International Delivery. We rarely get unhappy customers but for those who are we offer Free 30-Day returns.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>What tools are available to you?<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Banners updated with promotions and seasonal events<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Product feed which is fully automated and updated weekly<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Commissions ranging from&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">10-15%<\/span>&nbsp;of basket value<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Cookie length: 30 Days<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Affiliate Approval: automatic<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Voucher codes: exclusive codes available to closed user groups\/communities<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Terms and Conditions:<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">PPC Policy: Restricted<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Brand bidding is permitted on agreement<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Bidding on generic term gut health terms&nbsp;is allowed.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Commissions are most commonly declined due to a sale been&nbsp;allocated to&nbsp;a different marketing channel or same order being recorded twice. This will be flagged in the decline reason.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Bimuno allow the below promotional types of affiliates on the programme:<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">CashBack<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Community<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Content<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Discount Code<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Email<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Loyalty<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">PPC<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Sites with the below content are not allowed:<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Adult sites, gambling sites, sites which promote violence or unseemly behaviour.&nbsp; Any sites not appropriate to our brand<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Subnetworks<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">If you operate a subnetwork through your publisher account you must inform the Bimuno affiliate team and a list of all URLs promoting Bimuno&nbsp;should be supplied. Clasado (Trading as Bimuno)&nbsp;reserve the right to decline individual URLs if not deemed editorially appropriate.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Any URL which joins a subnetwork will join on the Standard Awin Programme rates unless agreed otherwise in writing with the Bimuno affiliate team.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Failure to adhere to these conditions may result in immediate removal from the Bimuno&nbsp;programme of either the URL and \/ or where necessary, the subnetwork.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Disputed transactions<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The merchant will investigate disputed transactions within 30&nbsp;days from submission.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliate Removals<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Awin will review all affiliates on a monthly basis who have been inactive for the past three months. Inactive is defined in this instance as any affiliate who has not driven a sale within that time period. This may result in removal from the programme. Those affiliates who have been removed through inactivity are welcome to re-apply to the programme, but must go through the approval process once again.&nbsp;<\/p>","