 tech and TVs, to all-singing, all-dancing washing machines, fridges and ovens.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">AO.com Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">AO Affiliate Programme<\/span>&nbsp;<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You won\u2019t find anyone more passionate about tech and electricals than us. Our Online Electricals Store has everything from the latest smart tech and TVs, to all-singing, all-dancing washing machines, fridges and&nbsp;ovens.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We\u2019ll help you pick the perfect laptop for that last-minute homework, deliver you a TV for your latest boxset binge, and keep in touch with updates when your cooker\u2019s in the back of our truck.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Nothing pleases us more than dropping off a shiny new fridge in its new home. Trouble is, old fridges are pretty tricky to dispose of. That\u2019s why we built our very own recycling plant to safely do it for&nbsp;us.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We\u2019ll take away your old appliance, lovingly crush it in our clever machine and recycle the bits that come out the other end. So, you can rest easy knowing you\u2019ve done your bit, and we\u2019ll rest easy knowing we\u2019ve saved you a trip to the&nbsp;tip!<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">UK\u2019s Most Trusted Electrical Retailer. To verify trust, visit&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/ao.com\/trust\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">https:\/\/ao.com\/trust<\/a>&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Why Promote AO?<\/span><\/h4><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Fast &amp; free delivery<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Quick installation offered<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Finance options available on 1000s of products<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Competitive pricing \u2013 AO checks every price, everywhere, everyday<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">8 million site views a month and growing<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 day cookie period<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Inhouse affiliate team<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Exclusive affiliate discounts and promotions<\/li><\/ul><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Commission Rates<\/span><\/h4><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Minimum 0.4% commission with opportunity to set up higher bespoke rates<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Contact details<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">If you would like to discuss any aspect of the programme further or require additional information then please do not hesitate to contact the AO Affiliate Team, email:&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:affiliate@ao.com\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">affiliate@ao.com<\/a><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Under the AO plc umbrella we&nbsp; also have<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Mobile Phones Direct<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">AO Business<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Boots Kitchen Appliances<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;so please get in touch if you are also interested in advertising these brands.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Voucher Codes:<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- AO may from time to time issue promotion or voucher codes in an effort to promote sales. Publishers should only promote voucher codes that are provided to it in writing or otherwise through the Affiliate Program. AO reserves the right to withhold payment of commission if non-authorised voucher codes are used in connection with Relevant Sales.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Voucher code terms and conditions specified by AO (VCTCs) must be clearly displayed onsite. Where voucher codes are issued with an expiry date this should be clearly displayed and codes should be removed or explicitly marked as expired after this date. AO reserves the right not to pay commission to any Affiliate found to be displaying unauthorised codes or found to be displaying voucher codes but without the VCTCs until the code(s) are removed\/VCTCs are displayed.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Affiliates must adhere to voucher code best practice guidelines from time to time in force (including but not limited to those set by the Internet Advertising Bureau UK) at all times.<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Cashback Transaction Queries:<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please be advised that cashback queries need to be raised by the customer within 120 days of purchase of untracked sales, and 120 days of validation for tracked sales to ensure that we are able to properly deal with requests.<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Paid Advertising Restriction:<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates are not entitled use paid search advertising and to bid on any keywords which include reference to the \u201cAO\u201d name or business, or any misspellings or confusingly similar words or variations on the below:<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- AO<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">-&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/eur01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com\/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fao.com%2F&amp;data=04%7C01%7Csusan.payne%40awin.com%7Cc41974f3429b48fdb8cf08d87fe3651c%7C5a9ab2d37b5845259851d1727266bad7%7C0%7C0%7C63739996193