ot;:400,&quot;y&quot;:77,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:22,&quot;abs_x&quot;:653,&quot;abs_y&quot;:353}\"><strong bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:400,&quot;y&quot;:101,&quot;w&quot;:390,&quot;h&quot;:45,&quot;abs_x&quot;:653,&quot;abs_y&quot;:377}\">WELCOME TO<br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:537,&quot;y&quot;:101,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:22,&quot;abs_x&quot;:790,&quot;abs_y&quot;:377}\">THE SPORTITUDE AFFILIATE PROGRAM<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:390,&quot;y&quot;:157,&quot;w&quot;:430,&quot;h&quot;:663,&quot;abs_x&quot;:643,&quot;abs_y&quot;:433}\"><td align=\"left\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:390,&quot;y&quot;:157,&quot;w&quot;:430,&quot;h&quot;:663,&quot;abs_x&quot;:643,&quot;abs_y&quot;:433}\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); padding: 5px;\"><p bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:395,&quot;y&quot;:162,&quot;w&quot;:420,&quot;h&quot;:26,&quot;abs_x&quot;:648,&quot;abs_y&quot;:438}\">From 2011 to Feb 2015 we were known as SlashSport. The time came for us to evolve to a new brand that better supports our vision and values.<\/p><p bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:395,&quot;y&quot;:201,&quot;w&quot;:420,&quot;h&quot;:26,&quot;abs_x&quot;:648,&quot;abs_y&quot;:477}\">SPORTITUDE is more than just Australia's newest online sports shopping destination.<\/p><p bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:395,&quot;y&quot;:240,&quot;w&quot;:420,&quot;h&quot;:80,&quot;abs_x&quot;:648,&quot;abs_y&quot;:516}\">At SPORTITUDE we believe the secret to a happier life is mastering your ARC - that's having the right Attitude, having Respect for all others and having Confidence in yourself. Playing sport and keeping fit and healthy are all activities that lead to constant personal and team achievements. No matter how big or small these achievements are, they all contribute positively to the 3 key traits of your ARC.<\/p><p bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:395,&quot;y&quot;:332,&quot;w&quot;:420,&quot;h&quot;:40,&quot;abs_x&quot;:648,&quot;abs_y&quot;:608}\">Our mission is to provide customers with the inspiration, motivation, support, advice, service and the best sports gear for every little milestone and achievement on your journey to building your ARC and living a happy life.<\/p><p bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:395,&quot;y&quot;:384,&quot;w&quot;:420,&quot;h&quot;:40,&quot;abs_x&quot;:648,&quot;abs_y&quot;:660}\">SPORTITUDE offers a huge range of authentic sports shoes, apparel, equipment, books and supplements from top specialist sports brands and retailers.<\/p><p bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:395,&quot;y&quot;:436,&quot;w&quot;:420,&quot;h&quot;:53,&quot;abs_x&quot;:648,&quot;abs_y&quot;:712}\">The product range covers 40 sports and over 200 brands. Free shipping is available on thousands of products with 30 day returns and exchanges. Our customer satisfaction rating for service has consistently been at or above 98% through independently gathered feedback by Feefo.<\/p><strong bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:395,&quot;y&quot;:501,&quot;w&quot;:99,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:648,&quot;abs_y&quot;:777}\">Program Benefits<\/strong><ul bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:395,&quot;y&quot;:526,&quot;w&quot;:420,&quot;h&quot;:40,&quot;abs_x&quot;:648,&quot;abs_y&quot;:802}\"><li bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:435,&quot;y&quot;:526,&quot;w&quot;:380,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:688,&quot;abs_y&quot;:802}\">7% commission for affiliates.<\/li><li bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:435,&quot;y&quot;:540,&quot;w&quot;:380,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:688,&quot;abs_y&quot;:816}\">30 day cookie with all valid transactions approved within 30 days.<\/li><li bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:435,&quot;y&quot;:553,&quot;w&quot;:380,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:688,&quot;abs_y&quot;:829}\">Regularly updated data feed with thousands of products.<\/li><\/ul><strong bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:395,&quot;y&quot;:578,&quot;w&quot;:121,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:648,&quot;abs_y&quot;:854}\">Program Restrictions<\/strong><ul bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:395,&quot;y&quot;:604,&quot;w&quot;:420,&quot;h&quot;:173,&quot;abs_x&quot;:648,&quot;abs_y&quot;:880}\"><li bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:435,&quot;y&quot;:604,&quot;w&quot;:380,&quot;h&quot;:26,&quot;abs_x&quot;:688,&quot;abs_y&quot;:880}\">We do not allow any Facebook PPC advertising campaigns. We reserve the right to exclusively promote within this channel.<\/li><li bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:435,&quot;y&quot;:630,&quot;w&quot;:380,&quot;h&quot;:26,&quot;abs_x&quot;:688,&quot;abs_y&quot;:906}\">Other forms of PPC advertising are acceptable so long as affiliates are not bidding on our trademarks and trademarks of our products.<\/li><li bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:435,&quot;y&quot;:657,&quot;w&quot;:380,&quot;h&quot;:40,&quot;abs_x&quot;:688,&quot;abs_y&quot;:933}\">We do not allow any Direct to Merchant PPC advertising, please ensure if you're using this channel that all traffic is directed through your own website.<\/li><li bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:435,&quot;y&quot;:697,&quot;w&quot;:380,&quot;h&quot;:40,&quot;abs_x&quot;:688,&quot;abs_y&quot;:973}\">Coupon affiliates may only apply affiliate links to coupons supplied to them through LinkShare. Any sales generated through non-affiliate coupons will be declined.<\/li><li bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:435,&quot;y&quot;:737,&quot;w&quot;:380,&quot;h&quot;:40,&quot;abs_x&quot;:688,&quot;abs_y&quot;:1013}\">All traffic sources must be approved by SPORTITUDE. You must update your traffic source if you decide to add another website, or change a previously approved one.<\/li><\/ul>Sincerely,<br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:446,&quot;y&quot;:789,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:699,&quot;abs_y&quot;:1065}\">SPORTITUDE Affiliate Team<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>","program_policies":"<table class=\"table table-bordered table-striped\" style=\"max-width: 100%; background-color: transparent; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0px; width: 1038.02