ellery to your website by joining the Angara Affiliate Program. Referred from your website, you'll earn commission on over 7,000+ products including rings, earrings, necklaces and much more.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Angara DE Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">PARTNERSHIP HIGHLIGHTS<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Earn 8% commission on every order from&nbsp;first channel and 3% commission on every order from&nbsp;last channel.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Access to a great selection of data feeds, text links, banners and other marketing tools.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Aggressive affiliate incentives, bonuses and much more.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Dedicated Affiliate Team to make sure you achieve your goals.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Access to 24\/7 robust reporting and monitoring system via Affiliate Partnership Network.<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Introduction<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The terms in this Agreement include the following:<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\"you\" or \"your\" means the applicant interested in participating in the Program,<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\"we\", \"us\" \"our\" would mean Angara.com on acceptance of participation from our end<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\"our website\" indicates Angara.com website currently located at www.angara.com<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\"your website\" means the World Wide Website from which you will link to our site<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\"Affiliate\" means a party accepted as a member of the Program<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\"User\" means a customer who links from your website to ours<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\"Product\" indicates any merchandise offered for sale by us on our website<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\"Affiliate Site\" means an Affiliate website that has been accepted as an Affiliate of Angara.com and<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">\"Link\" or \"Links\" means banner advertisements, buttons, links or text links that link to the Angara.com website.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Program Acceptance<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The first step is to complete the Angara.com Affiliate Application and accept the terms and conditions of the Agreement. We then review your completed application and decide whether or not to accept your participation in the Program. We hold complete discretion of accepting or rejecting your application and may reject websites that are inappropriate or objectionable. These include sites of the following nature:<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Website that promote violence and are defamatory.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Websites that promote illegal activities.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Website that discriminate on the basis of age, nationality, disability, religion, sex or sexual orientation.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Website under construction that contain little or no material.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Websites that contain sexually explicit, obscene, harmful or harassing images.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Websites that cannot be accessed at the time of our application review.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Websites that contain otherwise objectionable material.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Websites that incorporate material that infringe upon third party copyright, trademark or intellectual property rights.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In case of rejection of Application, you will not be eligible to participate in the Program this time. You may however, re-apply any time later. We possess complete discretion of rejecting an Application even after communicating acceptance to you. We may even remove an Affiliate from the Program at any time we feel the necessity to do so.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Linking Requirements<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Once you become an Affiliate Site in our Program, we will provide your site with links. On clicking these, users will directly reach our site. You may display these links on your site keeping in mind the terms and conditions specified. We will provide you with information that we feel is necessary for you to make appropriate links from your site to ours. On accepting the Terms of the Agreement you are bound to cooperate with Angara.com in order to maintain such links. Furthermore, you agree to<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Similar Link\/Links to be displayed prominently on your site as you consider fit, but with our consent.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">No Link\/Links can be altered or modified without our consent.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">No Link\/Links on your site can be modified in a way that alters the feel\/message\/functionality of our site.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The right to monitor your site at any given time, to see it is in compliance with the terms and conditions specified, lies with us. However, you will have sole responsibility of all content, links and activities included in your site. No official from Angara.com will be responsible for any liability claims, damages or expenses pertaining to the operation, development, maintenance, content, link or activities of your site.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">With reference to the Awin Terms and Conditions, you agree to the following<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You will not place or use any links of Angara.com except with the intention of delivering valid sales, leads, applications, accounts, clicks or other specified compensable actions;<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You shall not increase the number of clicks, applications, accounts etc, by any method whatsoever. Your Application will be terminated with immediate effect in such a case and no outstanding or future commissions will be paid.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Partner's Responsibility<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">By using a special URL specified in the Engagement (The \"Required URLs\"), the Partner will link its site to areas within Angara.com's site. Partner may post as many links to the Required URLs and the rest of Angara.com's site as it likes on Partner's site. The position, importance and nature of links on the Partner's site shall be in sync with any requirements specified in the Engagement, which otherwise will be the discretion of Partner.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The Partner cannot agree make any representations, warranties or other statements concerning Angara.com, Angara.com's site, or any of Angara.com's products or services, or Angara.com's site policies, except as expressly authorized by the Engagement.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The Partner is responsible for intimating Angara.com and The Awin Networks of any malfunctioning of the Required URLs or other problems with Partner's participation in the Engagement. Angara.com will respond promptly to all concerns upon notification by Partner.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">At any time prior to Partner providing a Qualifying Link, Angara.com may with or without notice<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">change, suspend or discontinue any aspect of an Offer or an Engagement or<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">remove, alter, or modify any graphic or banner ad submitted by Angara.com for an Offer or an Engagement.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Partner agrees to promptly implement any request from Angara.com to remove, alter or modify any graphic or banner ad submitted by Angara.com that is being used by Partner as part of an Engagement.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Order Processing<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">All orders that come to us through the links will be processed by us. It will be our discretion to reject orders that do not qualify our requirements if any.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Licenses<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You grant us a non-exclusive license to utilize your names, titles, logos, trademarks and urls (collectively, the \"Affiliate Trademarks\") to advertise, market, promote and publicize in any manner. However, we shall not be required to advertise, market, promote or publicize your Web site. You hereby represent and warrant that you are the sole and exclusive owner of the Affiliate Trademarks and have the right and power to grant us the license to use the same contemplated in this Agreement and that such grant does not and will not<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">breach, conflict with or constitute a default under any agreement or other instrument applicable to you or binding upon you or<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">infringe upon any trademark, trade name, service mark, copyright or other proprietary right of any other person or entity.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">This license shall terminate upon the effective date of the expiration or termination of this Agreement.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Any affiliates violating this policy may be terminated without notice and forfeit all outstanding and future commissions.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In addition, Affiliate may not claim to be Angara.com and must clearly state the nature of the Affiliate relationship. Affiliates violating this policy may be terminated without notice and forfeit all commissions.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Commission and Payment<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The commission structure of the Angara Affiliate program is as follows:<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Earn flat 5% of every sale you generate for colored gemstones, gemstone jewellery, semi-mounts, silver jewellery, loose diamonds\/diamond jewellery<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Increasing or decreasing the revenue share percentage will remain our sole discretion. Angara.com will also provide special promotional commissions for special events, product categories or periods of time at our sole discretion. Approximately thirty days after the end of each calendar month during the term of this Agreement, we will pay the Referral Fees due for the month (one month lead-time for Awin verification period). All Referral Fees will be paid in United States Dollars. Payment schedule may vary during Christmas and Valentine's periods.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We will have no obligation to pay any Referral Fee for orders that are<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">cancelled or returned<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">placed after the termination of this Agreement.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">All Referral Fees previously paid with respect to orders that are cancelled or returned shall be deducted from the next payment due.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Ineligible Commission<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You will not be eligible for Commission in case of the following:<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">A customer comes to Angara through your website but purchases using a \"discount code\" or a \"reference code\" that discounts their purchase, unless the code is provided to you directly from the Angara affiliate managers or it's obtained from the \"Create Links\" section in the Awin web site.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">A customer comes to Angara through your website and does not purchase anything and then returns to Angara via another affiliate or partner at a later date and then makes a purchase, the second affiliate will receive commission for the sale.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">A customer comes to Angara through website and returns after 45 days by entering our URL directly, then you will not receive commission for that later purchase.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">If the customer cannot be tracked for any reason, by our online ordering system.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">If the customer prevents cookies from being saved on his, her hard drive.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Spam<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Partner understands that the use of unsolicited commercial e-mail (\"spam\") by affiliates is absolutely prohibited. Your participation in the Angara.com affiliate program constitutes your specific and unconditional agreement to abide this anti-spam policy. Proper e-mail solicitation, however, can be an important means of advertising your site and your relationship with Angara.com. The following rules represent best practices, which are permitted under this agreement:<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">If an \"opt-In\" system exists for your line of business and target market, you may use it. (Opt-In systems are those where the user specifically requests to be placed on a mailing list.)<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Violation of this rule will result in the suspension or termination of your affiliate relationship with Angara.com including the penalization of any commissions from the date of the offending e-mailing.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">New York State Affiliates<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">For affiliate partners based in New York State or having office(s) located within New York State, Angara.com will only permit the affiliate partner to promote the Angara.com brand and\/or web site via the affiliate partner's web site and not through any other marketing channel. The affiliate partner may not promote Angara.com through any other marketing channel including, but not limited to:<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">paid search marketing<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">e-mail marketing<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">lead generation<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">mobile marketing<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">telemarketing<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">flyers<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Agreement Modification<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Any of the terms and conditions contained in this Agreement may be modified at any time and in our sole discretion, by posting a change notice or new agreement on our site. Notice of any change to this Agreement delivered by e-mail, to your address on our records, or