ticular purpose, or arising out of course of performance, course of dealing or usage of trade. We do not warrant that our web site or products will be error free, function without interruption or that any errors will be corrected. If as a matter of law we may not disclaim any warranty, the scope and duration of such warranty shall be the minimum permissible under applicable law.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Unauthorized marketing tools<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We believe in an affiliate-friendly environment for our affiliates. One that provides a win-win situation. However, you are prohibited from using any Angara marketing tools such as promotional codes shown on our website or emails. We will provide you the necessary marketing tools to help you succeed. Any use will result in debiting your commissions for the transaction(s) and possibly terminating our partnership.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Bidding on Angara<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You are prohibited from bidding on 'Angara' brand name keywords and key phrases. Any use will result in debiting your commissions for the transaction(s) and possibly terminating our partnership.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">If you have any further questions at any point in time, please do not hesitate to contact us toll free at 0800.368.8742 or email us at affiliate@angara.com. We look forward to our business partnership, helping you meet, and exceed, your goals.se click here to add your program terms.<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.angara.com\/de\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=33151&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:06:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T10:56:30.000000Z","delete