-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>1. KEYWORD BUYING<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Purchasing keywords in networks and search engines is only allowed:<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">When the advertisement links to your own website\/intermediate page (no automatic interstitial or redirects).<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">If the necessary negative keywords have been entered in order to exclude the situations below.<\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Not allowed:<\/b><\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Bid on brands of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhuellen.de<\/span>, relatives or misspellings thereof, for example:&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhullen.de, Hadnyhuellen.de, Handyhulen.de<\/span>.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">If keyword buying is used, the correct negative keywords must be included. It is not allowed that advertisements from publishers are shown for search terms that contain the advertiser's trademarks. (for example&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhuellen.de, Selencia, Accezz<\/span>).<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">This concerns the exact brand (e.g.&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhuellen.de, Selencia, Accezz<\/span>), misspellings of the brand (e.g.&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhullen.de, Hadnyhuellen.de, Handyhulen.de, Acezz, Accez, iMoshon, iMoshoin,&nbsp;Selenzia, Selensia, Salencia<\/span>) and brand names in combination with other words (for example&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhuellen.de iPhone X case, Selencia Samsung Galaxy Note 9 case, Accezz USB cable<\/span>).<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Use of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhuellen.de<\/span>&nbsp;brand names or combinations thereof, related\/misspellings in advertisement text and\/or visible URL in the form of domain or subdomain (<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhuellende.mydomain.de<\/span>&nbsp;is therefore not allowed,&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">mydomain.de\/Handyhuellende<\/span>&nbsp;is allowed).<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Advertising of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhuellen.de<\/span>&nbsp;products via the CSS module of and on the Google Shopping platform.<\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>2. EMAIL MARKETING<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Email marketing is only allowed within the affiliate program of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhuellen.de<\/span>&nbsp;with exceptional permission from&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhuellen.de<\/span>&nbsp;and subject to a number of conditions:<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">The Publisher must be demonstrably compliant with the provisions of all relevant legislation and regulations;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Only email addresses obtained through a double opt-in and compliant according to (among other things) relevant regulations may be used;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">The publisher must adhere to the rules of conduct established by Awin in the Awin Code of Conduct. Awin&nbsp;must be in possession of a signed version of the Awin Code of Conduct so that it is transferable at all times at&nbsp;request.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">The name&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhuellen.de<\/span>&nbsp;and the aforementioned brand names may not be used in the sender of e-mails;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Publishers are not allowed to impersonate an official representation of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhuellen.de<\/span>&nbsp;in the promotion via email;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">The Publisher is responsible for any consequences imposed if it is or has been guilty of sending spam or sending e-mails that are in any way not compliant with the above legislation, codes of conduct and\/or guidelines;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">It is necessary that all e-mails\/newsletters to be sent are submitted in advance to&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhuellen.de<\/span>&nbsp;for approval via the E-mail Approval Tool, so that written permission can be given by&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhuellen.de<\/span>&nbsp;prior to sending the e-mail\/newsletter.&nbsp;This includes all e-mail communications, newsletters, self-developed texts, images, logos and trademark material.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Sending e-mail batches is only allowed in consultation (see also previous point) with&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Handyhuellen.de<\/span>. It must be indicated on which dates it is intended to send the e-mails, stating the expected number of e-mails per sending moment.<\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>3. TYPO \/ MISsp