f310a994-5efb-4ab2-9e21-323cc45d9813","8ae99f6d-d390-420c-b738-5699955ba938","5f2ce3f8-a7c5-4939-ab0e-9855a2713450"],"valid_domains":["tower-london.com","*.tower-london.com"],"short_description":"TOWER is London\u2019s fastest growing independent footwear retailer, found at the heart of our capital\u2019s engaging community. Our reputation spans two locations, boasting more than 40 years as a team bursting with creative ideas.","description":"<h2 class=\"margin-top-sm\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.25; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Tower London UK Affiliate Program<\/h2><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Founded in 1980 as a supplier of all things footwear, we are TOWER London.\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">To keep it brief, TOWER is an indie retailer situated at the centre of London's growing and engaging footwear community, playing host to five locations spread across the capital. We sport a\u202fnoteworthy reputation spanning 40 years as a team bursting with creative ideas and credible heritage, a feat accomplished whilst supporting\u202four local area in aid of charitable causes. \u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Beyond a physical presence, our vast online store allows us to reach outside of London and tap into multiple locations, whilst we run affiliate activity in the UK, DE and FR. So, if you have a site that covers other regions then please get in touch to discuss cross market opportunities.\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We are known for stocking a carefully curated edit of footwear brands representing both on-trend styles and particular favourites city-wide \u2013 simply put, we are as diverse as you are, a one-stop-shop per se. Our brands include Dr. Martens, Veja, Birkenstock, New Balance, Barbour, Kickers, Armani, Hugo Boss and many more listed&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.tower-london.com\/brands\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(255, 102, 0); cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\"><u style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">here.<\/u><\/a>\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">Welcome to the TOWER London affiliate programme.<\/span>\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">As an affiliate of TOWER London, we look to offer all our partners an attractive range of opportunities to work with us going forwards. These opportunities include:\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">A competitive base commission rate starting at 3% ranging upwards,&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Flexible rates across key brands, enabling us to work with you to incentivise different campaigns,\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The opportunity to activate content partnerships with commission on influence and unique collaborations,\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">An optimised product feed updated daily,\u202f&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-righ