ength.<\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">9.9 million VW drivers<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">9 million supporters of VfL Wolfsburg<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">2.4 million digital reach (via the club's own channels)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Approx. 430,000 stadium visitors per season<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Approx. 100,000 Volkswagen employees<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Benefit from the innovative radiance of VfL Wolfsburg:<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Modern shop infrastructure<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">100% VW subsidiary and mobility and technology hub<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Economically strongest city in Germany<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">International reach in the core target markets of China, Brazil, North and South America<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Over 400 products in the fan shop<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"vertical-a