e UK. From our humble beginnings, we\u2019ve blossomed into an international clothing giant and are widely recognised as a leader in online fashion.","description":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Welcome to the Boden affiliate programme.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Boden is one of the most successful and fastest growing online clothing companies in the UK. From our humble beginnings, we\u2019ve blossomed into an international clothing giant and are widely recognised as a leader in online fashion.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We do a pretty good job of making beautiful, colourful clothes for all the family that are sure to put a spring in anyone\u2019s step. You will find great pieces for babies, kids and teens in our Mini Boden and johnnieb ranges and timeless styles in our womenswear and menswear lines.<\/p><table style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; max-width: 100%;\"><tbody style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><h4>Benefits:<\/h4><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Earn 6% commission (3% for Voucher &amp; Cashback Affiliates)<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 A high $175 average order value<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Great discounts and incentives for your customers<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Access to our entire product inventory via a Product Feed<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Timely commission payments<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 A Dedicated affiliate management team<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>","program_policies":"<p><\/p><table style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; max-width: 100%;\"><tbody style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-top: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-top: 0px;\">The important thing to know is that if you become a Boden affiliate, you can \u2013 without any risk \u2013 enjoy part of our phenomenal success. Our thriving affiliate program benefits from a high commission rate and frequent promotions to encourage greater conversions.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><h4>So what are the benefits?<\/h4><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Earn 6% commission (3% for Voucher &amp; Cashback Affiliates)<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 A high $175 average order value<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Great discounts and incentives for your customers<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Access to our entire product inventory via a Product Feed<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Timely commission payments<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 A Dedicated affiliate management team<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Text links and creative can be found within the interface.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">As Boden runs a successful in-house PPC advertising campaign, we have prepared the following guidelines to ensure there is no conflict between ourselves and our affiliates.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In order to qualify for a Boden affiliate, you must accept these conditions.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please note that Boden are currently only accepting new affiliates that have a strong content focus in the verticals of fashion, lifestyle or parenting.&nbsp; This is so we can have a greater control of our branding within the affiliate channel.&nbsp; However, please feel free to contact the Boden affiliate team if you\u2019re keen to promote the brand.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Publishers of the Boden programme may only promote codes, offers and deals that are communicated via the affiliate channel.&nbsp; Boden may decline sales that are gained through promotion of an expired or unauthorised code, offer or deal. This programme does not accept&nbsp;browser extension tools.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><h4>Use of voucher codes<\/h4><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates may only promote codes that are provided through the Boden affiliate programme (either from the Affiliate Management Team or from Boden directly).<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You are ONLY permitted to promote codes which have been distributed to you by the Boden Affiliate Team or zanox Account Managers.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Boden reserve the right to withhold payment of commission if non-authorised voucher codes are used in an affiliate sale.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Where voucher codes are issued with an expiry date this should be clearly displayed and codes should be removed or explicitly marked as expired after this date unless you are advised otherwise. Any affiliates displaying expired codes without marking them as being expired may be suspended from the programme.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Boden do not work with voucher and deals sites through sub affiliate networks, and these partnerships have to be directly with Zanox<\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><h4>DO<\/h4><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Bid on generic keywords - for example, women's clothing catalogue, men's formal shirts.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Negatively bid on \"Boden\" so as not to appear under brand term searches.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><h4>DON\u00b4T<\/h4><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Link directly to the Boden website, or use an URL redirect to take the customer directly to the Boden website from a PPC advert.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Bid on the keyword \u2018Boden\u2019 or any misspelling of \u2018Boden\u2019 e.g. Bodem, bowden, bodum, bodden etc<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Bid on any keyword phrase containing the keyword \u2018Boden\u2019 or any misspelling of Boden e.g. www.bodenclothing.com.au, www.boden.co.uk, www.bodenusa.com, www.bodendirect.com, www.miniboden.com, www.jpboden.co.uk, www.jpboden.com, john boden, johnnieboden, www.bowden.com, bodun clothing, bodannusa etc<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Use Boden brand terms in ad titles or body or PPC ad.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Buy, own or bid on any domain names with the word \u2018Boden\u2019 or misspellings of \u2018Boden\u2019 in the URL. For example, wwwbodenusa.com, wwwboden.co.uk, wwwboden.co.uk<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Display Boden garments on Froogle\u2122 as we have our own Froogle\u2122 feeds already in place<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Conduct any form of typosquatting. Typosquatting is a form of cybersquatting which directs a person to a false website when they enter a misspelling of the intended website. For example, www.bodan.co.uk, www.bodunusa.com<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;\">Boden take the above guidelines very seriously and reserve the right to deny commission for the month that an affiliate has been keyword bidding or typosquatting. Boden will also consider banning affiliates who ignore these guidelines.<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><p><\/p>","url":"http:\/\/www.bodenclothing.com.au\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=10763&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T11:55:15.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"bodenclothing.com.au"}}  
