"><h4>DO<\/h4><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Bid on generic keywords - for example, women's clothing catalogue, men's formal shirts.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Negatively bid on \"Boden\" so as not to appear under brand term searches.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><h4>DON\u00b4T<\/h4><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Link directly to the Boden website, or use an URL redirect to take the customer directly to the Boden website from a PPC advert.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Bid on the keyword \u2018Boden\u2019 or any misspelling of \u2018Boden\u2019 e.g. Bodem, bowden, bodum, bodden etc<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Bid on any keyword phrase containing the keyword \u2018Boden\u2019 or any misspelling of Boden e.g. www.bodenclothing.com.au, www.boden.co.uk, www.bodenusa.com, www.bodendirect.com, www.miniboden.com, www.jpboden.co.uk, www.jpboden.com, john boden, johnnieboden, www.bowden.com, bodun clothing, bodannusa etc<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Use Boden brand terms in ad titles or body or PPC ad.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Buy, own or bid on any domain names with the word \u2018Boden\u2019 or misspellings of \u2018Boden\u2019 in the URL. For example, wwwbodenusa.com, wwwboden.co.uk, wwwboden.co.uk<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Display Boden garments on Froogle\u2122 as we have our own Froogle\u2122 feeds already in place<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Conduct any form of typosquatting. Typosquatting is a form of cybersquatting which directs a person to a false website when they enter a misspelling of the intended website. For example, www.bodan.co.uk, www.bodunusa.com<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;\">Boden take the above guidelines very seriously and reserve the right to deny commission for the month that an affiliate has been keyword bidding or typosquatting. Boden will also consider banning affiliates who ignore these guidelines.<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><p><\/p>","url":"http:\/\/www.bodenclothing.com.au\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=10763&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T11:55:15.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"bodenclothing.com.au"}}  
