r average cart price for 2023 is 252.26 Eur.","description":"<h1 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\">Welcome to the&nbsp;<strong>Alas Silk<\/strong>&nbsp;affiliate program!<\/h1><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\">Alas Silk is a young German fashion house that sells feminine mulberry silk clothing suitable for day and night. We fall into the&nbsp;affordable luxury category as all our designs are custom-made, products handmade&nbsp;and we sell them at very affordable prices compared to our competitors. All our products are named by the ancient Greek goddess as they are our muses. We celebrate femininity, quality, and fashion. Our average&nbsp;cart price for 2021 is 227.96 Eur.<\/p><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\">What do we offer partners?<\/p><ul style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><li>Advertising banners<\/li><li>Product feeds<\/li><li>Dedicated campaigns<\/li><li>Attractive commissions<\/li><li>Exclusive promotions for affiliate partners<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\">Baseline Offer Details:<\/p><ul style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><li>Commission: 15% (we are just starting with a program and to kickstart, we offer one of the highest commissions)<\/li><li>Cookie Window: 30 Days<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\">Upcoming:<\/p><ul style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><li>Promotions<\/li><li>Product Launches<\/li><li>Affiliate Program Updates<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\">For more information contact: alassi