in-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">37. The Merchant reserves the right to change the terms and conditions at any point, including the amount and types of commission.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">38. If the Affiliate doesn\u2019t accept the new terms and conditions, the agreement will be terminated. &nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">These terms and conditions take effect on 1. January 2018.<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.lentiamo.de\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=13983&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:15.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T11:16:09.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"lentiamo.de"}}  
