 Produktpalette<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Intensives Online-Unternehmen<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Schnelle Lieferung<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Kostenlose Lieferung ab 29\u20ac<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Zul\u00e4ssige Aktivit\u00e4ten:<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>\u00b7 Mailing-Kampagnen \u00b7 Blogs \u00b7 Inhaltsseiten Cashback \u00b7 Gutscheine Programmatisch Retargeting<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Kommission:<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Sale: 4%<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>English version:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Online store for pet products, which operates on the markets of Central Europe, including Poland and Germany. Over 13,000 articles for animals - from food and delicacies, through toys and care products, to lairs and transporters. We are distinguished by express and free delivery - we ship our orders even 24 hours after placing the order, and we deliver orders over 29 \u20ac for free. As a socially responsible company, we not only care for our clients' animals, but also support organizations that help animals in need. Nothing pleases us more than helping them provide them with food, a warm bed and proper care.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Benefits of cooperation with Fera24.de:<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>\u2022 A very large range of pr