com"],"short_description":"SMOOTH - SKIN - SCIENCE: Our mission is 'Softer, smoother healthier-looking skin for everybody'. Each of our products within our Body Skincare System are designed and proven to do this.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Ameliorate UK Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">AMELIORATE Skincare<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Hailed a \u2018miracle-worker\u2019 by industry experts, award-winning AMELIORATE is proven to give softer, smoother, healthier-looking skin to EVERYBODY.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Our mission is 'Softer, smoother healthier-looking skin for everybody'. Each of our products within our Body Skincare System are designed and proven to do this.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Designed for people with the skin condition, Keratosis Pilaris, the unique combination of ingredients within each product also hydrates very dry skin, prevents ingrown hairs and makes normal skin amazingly soft and smooth.&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Why Join our Programme?<\/span><\/h4><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Free UK delivery on all orders<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Our site is totally secure so you can browse and shop with confidence.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">We offer exclusive promotions for affiliates<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">We welcome partnership opportunities<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">We update our banners regularly to reflect the most recent site creative<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Weekly newsletters highlight the top products, offers and collaboration opportunities<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Standard Commission Rates<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Commission varies per publisher type for new and existing customer sales, please see table below for details.&nbsp;<\/span><\/span>Please also note commission is not paid on delivery costs or gift voucher sales.<\/p><table style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; max-width: 100%;\"><tbody style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-top: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-top: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Publisher Group<\/span><\/p><\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-top: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Standard Rates<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Content &amp; Influencers:<\/p><\/td><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; marg