y date this should be clearly displayed and codes should be removed or explicitly marked as expired after this date. AO reserves the right not to pay commission to any Affiliate found to be displaying unauthorised codes or found to be displaying voucher codes but without the VCTCs until the code(s) are removed\/VCTCs are displayed.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Affiliates must adhere to voucher code best practice guidelines from time to time in force (including but not limited to those set by the Internet Advertising Bureau UK) at all times.<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Cashback Transaction Queries:<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please be advised that cashback queries need to be raised by the customer within 120 days of purchase of untracked sales, and 120 days of validation for tracked sales to ensure that we are able to properly deal with requests.<\/p><h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Paid Advertising Restriction:<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates are not entitled use paid search advertising and to bid on any keywords which include reference to the \u201cAO\u201d name or business, or any misspellings or confusingly similar words or variations on the below:<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- AO<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">-&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/eur01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com\/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fao.com%2F&amp;data=04%7C01%7Csusan.payne%40awin.com%7Cc41974f3429b48fdb8cf08d87fe3651c%7C5a9ab2d37b5845259851d1727266bad7%7C0%7C0%7C637399961931900764%