branding to better align with our mission to support head shavers across the globe.Our 4th generation head shaver is a revolutionary machine that promises the easiest head shave to date.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Goldskull Pro Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We are GoldSkull - skull polishers &amp; head enhancers. We exist to destroy dodgy comb overs and wistful head sprouts. We celebrate bald, shaved &amp; buzzed.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Ears, nose, beard and body also welcome to the shaving party with our 6in1 shavers<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Our head and body shavers have been designed to provide effortless shaving for men and women. Packed full of accessories, we have you covered from your head to your toes. Try GoldSkull today and look forward to a lifetime of satisfying shaves.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Shaving your head can be a pain.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>GoldSkull is the world's first electric razor for shaving heads, and it\u2019s designed to make life easier for those who shave their heads every day. It features a patented blade system that cuts hair at skin level so you get an ultra-close shave without any nicks or irritation. The ergonomic design is easy to hold and use, even with one hand. And its powerful battery will last up to 90 minutes on a single charge \u2013 enough time for most people to shave their entire head&nbsp;multiple times before needing another charge!<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You don't have time in your morning routine? We've got you covered! With the GoldSkull Electric Razor, you'll never need more than&nbsp;5 minutes of prep time again - just plug into a USB charger when you need more juice and you're good to go. No more waiting around for hours until your shaver has charged up fully - this baby will be ready as soon as you are!<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Why work with us?<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Innovative quality products<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">5* customer reviews<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Strong commission rates with incentivised tiers available.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Strong conversion rates<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Regular competitive consumer offers for promotion.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Exclusive and bespoke promotional opportunities are available, please get in touch.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Promotions and Offers<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">No Interest, BUY NOW PAY LATER options<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Monthly promotions and offers<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Bespoke offers available<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">CPA increases&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Incentivised commission structure<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We would love to hear of any opportunities for us to work together and would be happy to discuss any bespoke campaign ideas, please get in touch if you would like to work more closely with us.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Thanks,&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The GoldSkull Team<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":null,"url":"https:\/\/goldskullpro.com\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=25008&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:45:30.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"goldskullpro.com"}}  
