t: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Guided tours all over the world<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Transportation solutions: rail tickets, busses, airport transfers, car rental and more<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Travel services: museum passes, wifi routers, sim cards<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Hotels and staycation&nbsp;packages&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">And many more!<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>So why Klook?<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- The most competitive rates<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Experiences all over the globe in local languages<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Instant confirmation and simple cancellation policy for the majority of products<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Program Highlights:<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Between 2% - 5% Commission Depending on the&nbsp;Activity&nbsp;purchased<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 Day Referral Period<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">60 days validation period<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Dedicated Account Manager<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Terms and Conditions<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Base Commission terms<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for&nbsp;Attractions &amp; Shows<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for&nbsp;Tours &amp; Sightseeing<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for&nbsp;Food &amp; Dining<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for&nbsp;Activities &amp; Experiences<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for&nbsp;Transport &amp; Wi-Fi<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for Hotel<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for Attraction Passes<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">5% for Car Rentals<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">2% for&nbsp;Special Activities<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">There is a 30-day cookie length on the Klook programme.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Voucher Codes&nbsp;<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates may only promote codes that are provided through the&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook&nbsp;<\/span>affiliate programme (either by AWIN or&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook&nbsp;<\/span>).<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook&nbsp;<\/span>reserves the right to withhold payment of commission if affiliates promote an unauthorised voucher code. Any affiliate found to be displaying unauthorised codes may also have their commission set to zero until the code(s) are removed.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Where voucher codes are issued with an expiry date this should be clearly displayed, and codes should be removed or explicitly marked as expired after this date unless you are advised otherwise. Any affiliates displaying expired codes without marking them as expired may be suspended from the programme. Please also ensure that you observe the IAB voucher code best practice guidelines.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Affiliate PPC Guidelines<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook&nbsp;<\/span>operates a strict policy on Paid Search activity including, but not limited to, search engines, advertising networks and social media placements. We do not allow paid search activity of any kind without the consent of&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook<\/span>. Consistent breach of this may result in commissions being declined and potentially being suspended from the programme.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Keywords<\/b><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In order to avoid any keyword matching issues, affiliates must add the following keywords as negative broad match to any and allPaid Search activity:<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Disneyland Paris, hong kong disneyland (due to the restriction imposed by HKDL), klook, klook deal, klook discount, klook hong kong, klook japan, klook korea, klook osaka, klook promo code, klook promo kode, klook code, klook discount code, klook discount, klook voucher, klook voucher code, klook coupon, klook coupon code, klook promotion, klook singapore, klook tokyo, klook travel, k look, k look hk, kllok, kk look, klook app, klook code, klook discount, klook hk, klook \u512a\u60e0, klook \u9999\u6e2f, \u5ba2\u8def, \u5ba2\u8def \u9999\u6e2f, klook china, klook \u4e2d\u56fd, klook \u4f18\u60e0, klook \u4f18\u60e0 \u7801, klook \u7968, klook\u4f18\u60e0, klook\u5ba2\u8def, klook\u8ba2\u7968, klook\u8bc4\u4ef7, \u5ba2 \u8def \u4f18\u60e0, \u5ba2 \u8def \u8bc4\u4ef7, \u5ba2\u8def, \u5ba2\u8def\u65c5\u884c, klook \ubc1c\ub9ac, klook \uc608\uc57d, klook \ucfe0\ud3f0, klook \ud560\uc778, klook \ud560\uc778\ucf54\ub4dc, klook \ud64d\ucf69, \ucf00\uc774\ub8e9, \ud074\ub8e9, \ud074\ub8e9\uc5b4\ud50c, \ud074\ub8e9\uc608\uc57d, \ud074\ub8e9\uc640\uc774\ud30c\uc774, \ud074\ub8e9\uc720\ub2c8\ubc84\uc124, \ud074\ub8e9\ud560\uc778, \ud074\ub8e9\ud560\uc778\ucf54\ub4dc, \ud074\ub8e9\ud560\uc778\ucfe0\ud3f0, \u30af\u30eb\u30c3\u30af, and other klook + destination KWs or any variations including misspellings, alternate spellings, alternate spacing, or any phrases that include these terms<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Launches<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">There will be select high profile launches that&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook&nbsp;<\/span>will not pay any commission on. These will be communicated by Awin through the news manager within 