should not be set up and could result in 0 commission and suspension from the programme if this activity is found in place.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Any queries may be addressed to the network or the specific programme contact.&nbsp;<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.ameliorate.com\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=15699&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:16.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T08:38:40.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":1,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"ameliorate.com"}}  
