, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;<\/span><br style=\"color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">Wir w\u00fcrden uns freuen, Sie bald als Partner begr\u00fc\u00dfen zu d\u00fcrfen.&nbsp;<\/span><br style=\"color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">F\u00fcr allgemeine R\u00fcckfragen oder exklusive Kooperationen stehen wir Ihnen gerne zur Verf\u00fcgung. Sie erreichen uns per E-Mail an&nbsp;<\/span><a href=\"mailto:service@helmade.com\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 153, 204); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">service@helmade.com<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">.&nbsp;<\/span><br style=\"color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;<\/span><br style=\"color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">Ihre Vorteile beim helmade Partnerprogramm:<\/span><br style=\"color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;<\/span><br style=\"color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">- Wir verg\u00fcten jeden Sale mit&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; color: rgb(40, 60, 67); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">8<\