rgin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Guided tours all over the world<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Transportation solutions: rail tickets, busses, airport transfers, car rental and more<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Travel services: museum passes, wifi routers, sim cards<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Hotels and staycation&nbsp;packages&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">And many more!<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>So why Klook?<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- The most competitive rates<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Experiences all over the globe in local languages<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Instant confirmation and simple cancellation policy for the majority of products<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Program Highlights:<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Between 2% - 5% Commission Depending on the&nbsp;Activity&nbsp;purchased<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 Day Referral Period<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">60 days validation period<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Dedicated Account Manager<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; 