oad match to any and allPaid Search activity:<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Disneyland Paris, hong kong disneyland (due to the restriction imposed by HKDL), klook, klook deal, klook discount, klook hong kong, klook japan, klook korea, klook osaka, klook promo code, klook promo kode, klook code, klook discount code, klook discount, klook voucher, klook voucher code, klook coupon, klook coupon code, klook promotion, klook singapore, klook tokyo, klook travel, k look, k look hk, kllok, kk look, klook app, klook code, klook discount, klook hk, klook \u512a\u60e0, klook \u9999\u6e2f, \u5ba2\u8def, \u5ba2\u8def \u9999\u6e2f, klook china, klook \u4e2d\u56fd, klook \u4f18\u60e0, klook \u4f18\u60e0 \u7801, klook \u7968, klook\u4f18\u60e0, klook\u5ba2\u8def, klook\u8ba2\u7968, klook\u8bc4\u4ef7, \u5ba2 \u8def \u4f18\u60e0, \u5ba2 \u8def \u8bc4\u4ef7, \u5ba2\u8def, \u5ba2\u8def\u65c5\u884c, klook \ubc1c\ub9ac, klook \uc608\uc57d, klook \ucfe0\ud3f0, klook \ud560\uc778, klook \ud560\uc778\ucf54\ub4dc, klook \ud64d\ucf69, \ucf00\uc774\ub8e9, \ud074\ub8e9, \ud074\ub8e9\uc5b4\ud50c, \ud074\ub8e9\uc608\uc57d, \ud074\ub8e9\uc640\uc774\ud30c\uc774, \ud074\ub8e9\uc720\ub2c8\ubc84\uc124, \ud074\ub8e9\ud560\uc778, \ud074\ub8e9\ud560\uc778\ucf54\ub4dc, \ud074\ub8e9\ud560\uc778\ucfe0\ud3f0, \u30af\u30eb\u30c3\u30af, and other klook + destination KWs or any variations including misspellings, alternate spellings, alternate spacing, or any phrases that include these terms<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Launches<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">There will be select high profile launches that&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Klook&nbsp;<\/span>will not pay any commission on. These will be communicated by Awin through the news manager within 24 hours o