Communications\/RakutenAdvertising\/LegoUS-13923\/-2022\/10Oct\/101122.jpg\" width=\"600\" class=\"mainBanner\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:220,&quot;y&quot;:105,&quot;w&quot;:600,&quot;h&quot;:382,&quot;abs_x&quot;:473,&quot;abs_y&quot;:381}\" style=\"border: 0px; height: auto; line-height: 16px; outline: none;\"><br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:820,&quot;y&quot;:472,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:18,&quot;abs_x&quot;:1073,&quot;abs_y&quot;:748}\"><\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:219,&quot;y&quot;:491,&quot;w&quot;:601,&quot;h&quot;:69,&quot;abs_x&quot;:472,&quot;abs_y&quot;:767}\"><td class=\"webfont\" align=\"center\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:219,&quot;y&quot;:491,&quot;w&quot;:601,&quot;h&quot;:69,&quot;abs_x&quot;:472,&quot;abs_y&quot;:767}\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-transform: uppercase;\">SAB\u00cdAS QU\u00c9?<\/td><\/tr><tr bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:219,&quot;y&quot;:560,&quot;w&quot;:601,&quot;h&quot;:500,&quot;abs_x&quot;:472,&quot;abs_y&quot;:836}\"><td align=\"left\" class=\"webfont\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:219,&quot;y&quot;:560,&quot;w&quot;:601,&quot;h&quot;:500,&quot;abs_x&quot;:472,&quot;abs_y&quot;:836}\" style=\"text-size-adjust: 100%; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; padding: 20px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 254); border-top: 1px solid rgb(237, 237, 237);\">El nombre LEGO<sup bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:334,&quot;y&quot;:581,&quot;w&quot;:8,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:587,&quot;abs_y&quot;:857}\">\u00ae<\/sup>&nbsp;est\u00e1 conformado por las primeras dos letras de las palabras danesas LEG GODT, que significan \u201cjugar bien\u201d.<br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:386,&quot;y&quot;:599,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:15,&quot;abs_x&quot;:639,&quot;abs_y&quot;:875}\">LEGO Group patent\u00f3 el ladrillo LEGO con los tubos familiares dentro y las piezas encima el 28 de enero de 1958.<br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:325,&quot;y&quot;:631,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:15,&quot;abs_x&quot;:578,&quot;abs_y&quot;:907}\"><br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:240,&quot;y&quot;:646,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:15,&quot;abs_x&quot;:493,&quot;abs_y&quot;:922}\">Todos los ladrillos LEGO 2 x 4 fabricados desde entonces se han producido con las mismas medidas que esta patente.<br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:337,&quot;y&quot;:677,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:15,&quot;abs_x&quot;:590,&quot;abs_y&quot;:953}\"><br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:240,&quot;y&quot;:693,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:15,&quot;abs_x&quot;:493,&quot;abs_y&quot;:969}\">Los ladrillos LEGO DUPLO tienen ocho veces el tama\u00f1o de los ladrillos LEGO originales, pero aun as\u00ed pueden encajar juntos.<br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:385,&quot;y&quot;:724,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:15,&quot;abs_x&quot;:638,&quot;abs_y&quot;:1000}\"><br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:240,&quot;y&quot;:739,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:15,&quot;abs_x&quot;:493,&quot;abs_y&quot;:1015}\">En promedio, cada persona del mundo tiene 86 ladrillos LEGO! En 2012, se produjeron 45.7 mil millones de ladrillos LEGO a un ritmo de 5.2 millones por hora.<br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:588,&quot;y&quot;:771,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:15,&quot;abs_x&quot;:841,&quot;abs_y&quot;:1047}\"><br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:240,&quot;y&quot;:786,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:15,&quot;abs_x&quot;:493,&quot;abs_y&quot;:1062}\">Si se colocan extremo con extremo, los ladrillos LEGO vendidos en 2012 dar\u00edan la vuelta al mundo m\u00e1s de 18 veces.<br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:334,&quot;y&quot;:817,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:15,&quot;abs_x&quot;:587,&quot;abs_y&quot;:1093}\"><br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:240,&quot;y&quot;:833,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:15,&quot;abs_x&quot;:493,&quot;abs_y&quot;:1109}\">Para llegar a la luna, necesitar\u00edas construir una columna de aproximadamente 40&nbsp;mil millones de ladrillos LEGO.<br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:324,&quot;y&quot;:864,&quot;w&quot;