rd, you give them James Wellbeloved. Inspired by nature, our wholesome, tasty recipes will keep them  full of energy and loving life for years to come.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">James Wellbeloved DE Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">For 30 years, pet owners have trusted us to help keep their furry friends happy, healthy and full of life.&nbsp;At James Wellbeloved we make healthy, delicious food that helps your pet eat and live better.&nbsp;Our tasty recipes are prepared with natural ingredients and are healthy for your pet.&nbsp;Because we all want our pets to love their food and live healthier, happier lives.&nbsp;<br><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Commission<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">James Wellbeloved pays a 3% commission on all one off purchases and a 10% commission on all subscription purchases. For extra exposure opportunities and increased commissions, please contact the Affiliate Account Manager.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Current Promotions<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please refer to the Toolbox for the latest creatives and offers. Please get in touch directly if you require any specific images, banners or assets.&nbsp;<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Commissions:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates will be paid 3% commission on all confirmed one off sales and 10% on all confirmed subscription sales<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">PPC<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">James Wellbeloved DE does not allow affiliates to bid on any of their trademarked terms, including miss-spells of the trademarks. Direct linking is not allowed on this programme. For a full explanation of the Trademark Guidelines view the terms and conditions for this programme.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">James Wellbeloved DE would like to inform its affiliates that it is restricting affiliates bidding on brand terms on all search engines. Any affiliates found to be bidding on brand terms will be removed from the programme. Any commission made on these sales will not be paid by the merchant.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates are prohibited from using Brand with Generic Terms unless an alternative agreement is in place.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please be aware that we carefully monitor paid for search on all competitive keywords and ask for your assistance in this process.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Display URLs.<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You cannot operate domains which contain trademarks for the sole purpose of driving traffic from search engines.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">It is important to note that affiliates must not use the display URL including any variation of this.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Any affiliate using this display URL may be removed from the programme.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates may not use trademarks term as a subdomain in their URL e.g.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates must use their own website which can include trademarks in the sub folders of the display URL e.g. www.affiliatesite.com\/Jameswellbeloved<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Email policy<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates are not permitted to send any unsolicited email (\"spam\") under this Affiliate programme. Should you wish to send out a James Wellbeloved DE email please discuss with EssenceMediaCom in the first instance.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Purchasing of domain names<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates cannot use any domain names that include the James Wellbeloved brands.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Discount\/Voucher Codes<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Only codes that are supplied to affiliates by James Wellbeloved DE are valid for affiliate use. Any codes that are found to be displayed on sites that are non-approved will result in commissions being declined. Please make sure any URL strings you grab from the James Wellbeloved site are placed into the deep link generator via your own affiliate account that the URL does not contain any additional tracking information\/tags as this will cause the link to not track correctly.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">If you have any questions regarding this programme please contact the&nbsp;James Wellbeloved affiliate team at EssenceMediacom.<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.jameswellbeloved.de\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=43095&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:06:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:46:11.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"jameswellbeloved.de"}}  
