que specialise in jewellery & gifts including: Personalised Jewellery, Womens jewellery, Wedding jewellery, Charm jewellery, Childrens jewellery, Mens jewellery, Personalised gifts","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Bloom Boutique Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Important Information:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 We offer a very competitive 8% commission<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;28 Days commission Payment<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;We offer FREE UK Post &amp; Luxury Gift Box with every order<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;We offer a FREE Luxury Gift Box with every international order<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Free advert design<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Free copywriting service<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;A photo library of fantastic images<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Dear Publisher,<\/b><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Welcome to Bloom Boutique!<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We specialise in beautifully handmade, personalised jewellery. From bespoke name necklaces to personalised birthstone bracelets, from infinity jewellery to heart charms, climber earrings to signet rings.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Combining personalisation with modern styling, our current jewellery &amp; gift collection can be personalised by adding names, dates, messages, birthstones, birth flowers and letter charms. Create an original necklace, bracelet or other gift for yourself or a loved one.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Mini Bloom, our kids\u2019 jewellery, gift &amp; toy collection, has been made especially for little wrists, small necks and tiny hands. Every aspect of our kids\u2019 jewellery, toys and gifts can be personalised with names, dates and messages. You can also add colourful birthstones, pearls and charms making Mini Bloom the perfect place to turn children\u2019s moments into memories. A great new addition to Mini Bloom is the Jellycat soft toy collection.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We also offer men's jewellery and gifts so you can create everything from Personalised Men's Name Bracelets to Engraved Silver Cufflinks, Watches, Pens and Hip Flasks.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We pride ourselves on taking care of individual needs. The Jewellers at Bloom Boutique are dedicated to creating one of a kind personalised gifts and our Dispatch Team hand-pick each personalised gift card presenting it with the jewellery or gift in a luxury Bloom Boutique gift box.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">No matter the occasion, from Christmas, Weddings, Anniversaries, Mother\u2019s Day, Father\u2019s Day and Valentine's Day, friend\u2019s Birthdays, or simply gifts for him and her, we have the personalised jewellery or gift to suit the occasion.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>We have a fantastic range of:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Gifts for her<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Gifts for him<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Necklaces<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Bracelets<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Earrings<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Personalised Jewellery<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Women\u2019s gifts &amp; Jewellery<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Wedding gifts &amp; Jewellery<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Charm Jewellery<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Children\u2019s Gifts &amp; Jewellery<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Children\u2019s Jellycat Soft Toys<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Men\u2019s Gifts &amp; Jewellery<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Personalised gifts<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We have a very strong business selling exclusively online.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We do everything in-house, from making and personalising jewellery, to photography and web design.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We have a great presence on Facebook and Instagram with over 100k followers and sell very well on our website producing hundreds of personalised orders everyday, rising to thousands during sales and holidays.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You can read more about the business here:&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.bloom-boutique.co.uk\/about\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">https:\/\/www.bloom-boutique.co.uk\/about<\/a><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We currently have over 1000 products in our shop window and an additional product feed for our top 20 items.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Click here to see our best-sellers:&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.bloom-boutique.co.uk\/best-selling-jewellery-gifts\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">https:\/\/www.bloom-boutique.co.uk\/best-selling-jewellery-gifts<\/a><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">If you would like something more bespoke, ie. different size adverts, bespoke adverts or bespoke discount codes then please get in touch.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>We want to help you sell our product!<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please do get in touch if you need any further information or assistance.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Kind regards<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Max Beer<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Director<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Bloom Boutique Ltd<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Unit 2, Wills Rd<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Totnes, Devon<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">TQ9 5XN, UK<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">M: 079790 22 100<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">E: max@bloom-boutique.co.uk<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">VAT: 176030916<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Commission Terms<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;We are offering a 8% commision<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;We pay within 28 Days<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Bloom Boutique currently run Search Marketing (e.g. Adwords, Google Shopping etc) &amp; Paid Targeted advertising on social media (e.g. Facebook &amp; Instagram) as well as retargeting campaigns - We are therefore, looking for partners to complement and add value to our current efforts<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;We don't want people to work on paid brand search for&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bloom-boutique.co.uk\/\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">www.bloom-boutique.co.uk<\/a>&nbsp;as we have that covered. ie. if people search for 'bloom boutique' we want our sponsored ad to come up not someone else's. You can sponsor other terms relating to Jewellery\/gift<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">BUT DO NOT SPONSOR OUR BRAND NAME!<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Promotional Codes<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The only discount code authorized for all affiliates to promote is \u201cBloom10\u201d unless otherwise agreed. If you'd like an exclusive code please reach out to our affiliate manager,&nbsp;<\/span><a href=\"mailto:Amy@AdvertisePurple.com\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Amy@AdvertisePurple.com<\/span><\/a><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;for further details.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We will not consider partners who are proposing to use:<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Search &gt; Direct Linking &gt; Publishers that navigate the user from 'search engine results' to the 'advertiser's website' with absolutely no other interim stages.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Mobile Search &gt; Publishers that run search advertising campaigns that navigate the user from 'search engine results' on a mobile device (such as a smartphone) to the 'advertiser's website'.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Social Search &gt; Publishers that run search advertising campaigns which navigate the user from 'social media websites' to the 'advertiser's website'.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Retargeting \/ Remarketing campaign.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Commission Terms<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Bloom Boutique Currently Run Search Marketing (e.g. Adwords, Google Shopping etc) &amp; Paid Targeted advertising on social media (e.g. Facebook &amp; Instagram) and retargetting campaigns. We are, therefore, looking for partners to compliment and add value to our current efforts.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We don't want people to work on paid brand search for&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bloom-boutique.co.uk\/\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">www.bloom-boutique.co.uk<\/a>&nbsp;as we have that covered<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">ie. if people search for 'bloom boutique' we want our sponsored ad to come up not someone elses<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">You can sponsor other&nbsp;terms relating to Jewellery\/gift BUT DO NOT SPONSOR OUR BRAND NAME!<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We will not consider partners who are proposing to use:<\/p><ol style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Search &gt; Direct Linking &gt; Publishers that navigate the user from 'search engine results' to the 'advertiser's website' with absolutely no other interim stages.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Mobile Search &gt; Publishers that run search advertising campaigns that navigate the user from 'search engine results' on a mobile device (such as a smart phone) to the 'advertiser's website'.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Social Search &gt; Publishers that run search advertising campaigns which navigate the user from 'social media websites' to the 'advertiser's website'.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Retargetting \/ Remarketing campaign<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/li><\/ol><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We are offering a 8% commision because we want to make it worth your while!<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We pay within 28 Days.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">All commissions are based on price inc VAT<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">All commission is inclusive of postage<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Returns policy - 30 days<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">If you have any specific queries please feel free to get in touch<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Commisions wont be paid if the item has been refunded<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">*8% is the base commision<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Max Beer<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Director<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Bloom Boutique Ltd<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Unit 2,&nbsp;Wills Rd<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Totnes<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">TQ9 5XN<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">T: 079790 22 100<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">VAT:&nbsp;176030916<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.bloom-boutique.co.uk\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=12287&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:15.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:42:42.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"bloom-boutique.co.uk"}}  
