htungsartikel. Damit du deine Favoriten jederzeit finden kannst, sind wir immer ein paar Schritte voraus.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Jotex DE Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Bei Jotex findest du immer die allerneuesten Einrichtungsartikel. Damit du deine Favoriten jederzeit finden kannst, sind wir immer ein paar Schritte voraus. Es ist egal ob du Trends folgst oder deine eigenen kreierst, Jotex ist das Ziel, um dein Zuhause zu versch\u00f6nern. Kaufe deine pers\u00f6nliche Einrichtung f\u00fcr dein Zuhause auf&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/jotex.de\/\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">jotex.de<\/a>!<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<div class=\"col-lg-12\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px;\"><div id=\"termsFreeTextContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea \" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Rules for advertising<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>Affiliates who do not comply with Awin and Jotex advertising rules will be suspended and will lose their earned compensation. In addition to the Awin Affiliate Agreement, the terms and conditions you agree to when advertising for Jotex are as follows:<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>-&nbsp;Newsletters<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>It is allowed to use Jotex in newsletters.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>- Discount codes<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>You are NOT allowed to use discount codes from email, paper mailings or any other advertising that Jotex sends directly to its customers. Commission will not be paid for sales generated with such discount codes. However, it is permitted to promote discount codes that Jotex communicates directly through Awin as well as any discounted prices and sale promotions that are communicated openly on the Jotex website. Jotex may also give selected affiliates the opportunity to work with discount codes. Terms and conditions and validity period of discount codes must be clearly stated.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>-&nbsp;Incentive and points sites<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>It is permitted to drive traffic to Jotex through so-called incentive and points sites.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>-&nbsp;Keyword policy<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>Jotex has a completely closed keyword policy. Buying the trademark \"Jotex\" is prohibited. It is also not allowed to buy any distinctions or misspellings of this word. It is also forbidden to drive traffic directly to Jotex through the purchase of sponsored links, regardless of the word.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">As a publisher, you are obliged to make it clear for consumers when your content contains advertising material. As an approved Awin Publisher you have agreed to follow local laws and standards as stipulated in section 9.2.4 and 9.2.5 of the&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.awin.com\/gb\/terms-and-conditions\/publisher-terms-and-conditions-2017\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">publisher terms and conditions<\/a>.<\/p