iscount codes from email, paper mailings or any other advertising that Jotex sends directly to its customers. Commission will not be paid for sales generated with such discount codes. However, it is permitted to promote discount codes that Jotex communicates directly through Awin as well as any discounted prices and sale promotions that are communicated openly on the Jotex website. Jotex may also give selected affiliates the opportunity to work with discount codes. Terms and conditions and validity period of discount codes must be clearly stated.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>-&nbsp;Incentive and points sites<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>It is permitted to drive traffic to Jotex through so-called incentive and points sites.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>-&nbsp;Keyword policy<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>Jotex has a completely closed keyword policy. Buying the trademark \"Jotex\" is prohibited. It is also not allowed to buy any distinctions or misspellings of this word. It is also forbidden to drive traffic directly to Jotex through the purchase of sponsored links, regardless of the word.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">As a publisher, you are obliged to make it clear for consumers when your content contains advertising material. As an approved Awin Publisher you have agreed to follow local laws and standards as stipulated in section 9.2.4 and 9.2.5 of the&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.awin.com\/gb\/terms-and-conditions\/publisher-terms-and-conditions-2017\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">publisher terms and conditions<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"margin-r