 more! ","description":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:46,&quot;w&quot;:1024,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:322}\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; margin: 15pt 0in 7.5pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:43,&quot;w&quot;:182,&quot;h&quot;:17,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:319}\"><span chronicle=\"\" display=\"\" new=\"\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:46,&quot;w&quot;:182,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:322}\" style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">YLANG 23'S PERSONAL TOUCH<o:p bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:190,&quot;y&quot;:46,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:443,&quot;abs_y&quot;:322}\"><\/o:p><\/span><\/b><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:72,&quot;w&quot;:1024,&quot;h&quot;:40,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:348}\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; margin: 9.4pt 0in; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:72,&quot;w&quot;:1012,&quot;h&quot;:40,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:348}\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: Helvetica; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">Once you've experienced Ylang 23's level of service, you won't want to shop any place else. We have personally met the designers, know the collections and can even find pieces from previous seasons. Imagine someone who can help you select the perfect gift or irresistible goodie for yourself, and who takes the time to personally gift wrap and ship the order within a day to your specifications.<o:p bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:472,&quot;y&quot;:99,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:725,&quot;abs_y&quot;:375}\"><\/o:p><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:125,&quot;w&quot;:1024,&quot;h&quot;:26,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:401}\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; margin: 9.4pt 0in; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:125,&quot;w&quot;:1021,&quot;h&quot;:26,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:401}\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: Helvetica; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">If you want to move to the ultimate level of service, join the many out-of-towners and Dallas Fashionistas who keep coming back to shop with us because we listen and understand what personal service really means. Drop us a line, or better yet, visit our beautiful Dallas store to stun your senses; we'd love to meet you.<o:p bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:987,&quot;y&quot;:138,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:1240,&quot;abs_y&quot;:414}\"><\/o:p><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:171,&quot;w&quot;:1024,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:447}\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; margin: 15pt 0in 7.5pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:168,&quot;w&quot;:152,&quot;h&quot;:17,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:444}\"><span chronicle=\"\" display=\"\" new=\"\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:171,&quot;w&quot;:152,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:447}\" style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">CELEBRATING 30+ YEARS<o:p bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:160,&quot;y&quot;:171,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:413,&quot;abs_y&quot;:447}\"><\/o:p><\/span><\/b><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:197,&quot;w&quot;:1024,&quot;h&quot;:53,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:473}\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; margin: 9.4pt 0in; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:197,&quot;w&quot;:1021,&quot;h&quot;:53,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:473}\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: Helvetica; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">Ylang 23 is committed to a curated blend of original jewelry designers whose passion and creativity shape worldwide trends. Central to the company\u2019s vision is the mix of collections it features, including lead designers Irene Neuwirth, Foundrae, Jennifer Meyer, Cathy Waterman, and Suzanne Kalan and newer, up and coming designers including Marla Aaron, Maria Tash, Carolina Bucci, and Retrouva\u00ed. In addition to its flagship online store, the company operates a store in Dallas in the Plaza at Preston Center.<o:p bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:161,&quot;y&quot;:237,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:414,&quot;abs_y&quot;:513}\"><\/o:p><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:271,&quot;w&quot;:1024,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:547}\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; margin: 15pt 0in 7.5pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:267,&quot;w&quot;:125,&quot;h&quot;:17,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:543}\"><span chronicle=\"\" display=\"\" new=\"\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:271,&quot;w&quot;:125,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:547}\" style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">... OF THE NEXT NOW<o:p bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:133,&quot;y&quot;:271,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:386,&quot;abs_y&quot;:547}\"><\/o:p><\/span><\/b><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:296,&quot;w&quot;:1024,&quot;h&quot;:53,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:572}\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; margin: 9.4pt 0in; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:296,&quot;w&quot;:1007,&quot;h&quot;:53,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:572}\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: Helvetica; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">Founders Joanne and Charles Teichman were the first in the US to offer designer jewelry in the mid-1980s and the first designer jewelry company to go online in 2000. They have created a culture of unmatched customer service and a tight-knit group of employees, some of whom have been with the company more than a decade. In addition, Joanne and Charles have continued to seek new designers, supporting their development and growth, while cultivating long-standing relationships with existing designers over time.<o:p bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:303,&quot;y&quot;:336,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:556,&quot;abs_y&quot;:612}\"><\/o:p><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:362,&quot;w&quot;:1024,&quot;h&quot;:40,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:638}\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; margin: 9.4pt 0in; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:362,&quot;w&quot;:1004,&quot;h&quot;:40,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:638}\" style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: Helvetica; letter-spacing: 0.75pt;\">In 2016, Joanne and Charles\u2019 daughter Alysa Teichman joined Ylang 23. Alysa has grown Ylang 23\u2019s footprint while breathing new life into the company as management from the next generation. Alysa founded THENEXTNOW, a competition for emerging jewelry designers and a tool to discover and cultivate the next generation of jewelry designers.<o:p bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:209,&quot;y&quot;:389,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:462,&quot;abs_y&quot;:665}\"><\/o:p><\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:422,&quot;w&quot;:1024,&quot;h&quot;:13,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:698}\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; margin: 15pt 0in 7.5pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><b bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:419,&quot;w&quot;:50,&quot;h&quot;:17,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:695}\"><span chronicle=\"\" display=\"\" new=\"\" bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot