ung der Partnerschaft!<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Es gelten die&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><a href=\"http:\/\/marketing.sg20.org\/werbemittel\/hgg\/Allgemeine%20Gesch%C3%A4ftsbedingungen%20f%C3%BCr%20das%20Partnerprogramm%20von%20Hirmer%20GROSSE%20GR%C3%96SSEN.pdf\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">Teilnahmebedingungen<\/a><\/span>.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Viel Erfolg w\u00fcnscht Ihnen Ihr Hirmer GROSSE GR\u00d6SSEN Affiliate-Team!<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Ihr pers\u00f6nlicher Ansprechpartner:<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>Hirmer Eckerle Service GmbH &amp; Co. KG<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">E-Mail: affilinet@hirmer-grosse-groessen.de<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<section id=\"content\" style=\"margin: 20px; padding: 0px; clear: both;\"><div class=\"row row-widget\" style=\"margin: 0px -10px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"col-md-9 col-lg-9 wrapper-widget\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px; min-height: 1px; float: left; width: 836.25px;\"><div class=\"profileTabContent widget padding-LR-null\" id=\"profileTabContent\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 25px; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 222, 222); display: inline-block; border-radius: 2px; width: 816.25px; position: relative;\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px;\"><div id=\"termsTabContent\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px;\"><div id=\"termsFreeTextContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea \" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margi