will receive a commission of \u20ac5.00<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">For every new annual subscription taken out via your AWIN link, you will receive a commission of \u20ac35.00<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Why join our program?<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">CHEEX is a company that wants to create sexual freedom for everyone.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Extremely high commission rates<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Tremendous value for clients providing a safe and ethical porn experience, as well as plenty of educational resources to explore their sexual self (tutorials, recurring live workshops with experts, articles)<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Mobile optimized website so affiliate sales can be tracked via mobile. Please see the Mobile Creative Banners and Links section.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 days cookie length<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">FREE CHEEX subscription (worth EUR 118.80) for you and 2 of your friends (just contact us at: affiliate@getcheex.com)<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Regular newsletter for partners with current initiatives, tips and suggestions for your website\/content\/social media<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Dedicated support&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Become affiliate of the month and get a shoutout on our social media channels (valid for influencers, content creators and blogs - from April 2023)<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Content Creation&nbsp;<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please note that if you use affiliate links in your Instagram Stories and other social channels, they must be marked with #ad to be ASA compliant. If you have any questions about this, please contact your account manager.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>CHEEX on social media<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Instagram:&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/getcheex\/\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">@getcheex<\/a><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">TikTok:&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.tiktok.com\/@getcheex\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">@getcheex<\/a><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Twitter:&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/getcheex\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">@GETCHEEX<\/a><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">________<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">ENGLISH<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">www.getchex.com&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">CHEEX is a platform that stands for a new, natural way and self-evident approach to sexuality. In addition to the free magazine and podcast, CHEEX offers members unlimited access to erotic films, sexy audio stories, and regular online workshops. CHEEX is convinced that a fulfilled sexuality is an essential part of a happy life and wants to help everyone to feel sexually liberated and fulfilled. That is why CHEEX shows intimacy in a very human way - pleasurable and consensual.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">CHEEX takes a clear stance and only offers fairly produced, pornographic content. Unlimited access to all content costs \u00a3\/\u20ac\/$ 14.90 per month with no minimum contract term (billed monthly) or \u00a3\/\u20ac\/$ 9.90 per month (billed in one payment at \u00a3\/\u20ac\/$ 118.80).<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>commissions<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">For every&nbsp;new&nbsp;monthly subscription started through your AWIN link, you will receive a commission of \u20ac5.00<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">For every&nbsp;new&nbsp;yearly subscription started through your AWIN link, you will receive a commission of \u20ac5.00<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Why Join our program?<\/b><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">CHEEX is a mission driven company that wants to create sexual freedom for everyone<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Highly competitive commission rates<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Huge value for customers, who are offering a safe and ethical porn experience, plus numerous educational resources to explore their sexual selves (tutorials, recurring live workshops with experts, articles)<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Mobile optimized site so affiliate sales will track through mobile. Please see the Banners and Links section for Mobile Creative.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">30 day cookie length<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">FREE CHEEX subscription (worth 118.80 EUR ) for you and 2 of your friends (please request it by contacting affiliate@getcheex.com)<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Regular affiliate newsletter with updated initiatives, tips and inspiration for your site\/content\/social media<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Dedicated support&nbsp;<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Receive a shoutout (become affiliate of the month by bringing the most customers) and get a shout out on our social media channels (valid for influencers, content creators and blogs - starting April 2023)<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Social Content Creators<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please note if you wish to use affiliate links within your Instagram Stories and other social channels, you will need to use #ad as the only valid identifier to be ASA compliant. Awin has a one-page website -&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/emea01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com\/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fpaidforadvertising.co.uk%2F&amp;data=02%7C01%7C%7Cab26d5b9843d4663d2f608d601d4e64f%7C5a9ab2d37b5845259851d1727266bad7%7C0%7C0%7C636698411229030022&amp;sdata=Dx95BlFzX0PLs%2FAOo4x80oq69S55T3GjhjWeCDZUvn0%3D&amp;reserved=0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">Paid for Advertising<\/a>&nbsp;&nbsp;- which explains how free content can have a commercial relationship attached to it. This can be linked to by any affiliate in order to make your readers aware of how affiliate links work. If you have any ques