 luxurious fleece, butter soft suede and crisp cotton weaves, plus a new range of Vegan Friendly options, all perfect for lounging, relaxing, working from home or getting outdoors.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We\u2019re committed to quality and it\u2019s what keeps our customers coming back.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">WHY JOIN THE BEDROOM ATHLETICS AFFILIATE PROGRAMME?<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>COMMISSION<\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">You can earn up to 8% commission on all approved sales.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>CREATIVE<\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Creative banners available to use right now.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Opportunity to request bespoke banners.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>COMMUNICATION<\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Regular communication to Publishers.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Afilliate Marketing Team on hand to answer any questions.<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","program_policies":"<div class=\"col-lg-12\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px; float: left; width: 870.25px;\"><div id=\"termsFreeTextContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea \" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 1