fantastic images<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Dear Publisher,<\/b><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Welcome to Bloom Boutique!<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We specialise in beautifully handmade, personalised jewellery. From bespoke name necklaces to personalised birthstone bracelets, from infinity jewellery to heart charms, climber earrings to signet rings.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Combining personalisation with modern styling, our current jewellery &amp; gift collection can be personalised by adding names, dates, messages, birthstones, birth flowers and letter charms. Create an original necklace, bracelet or other gift for yourself or a loved one.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Mini Bloom, our kids\u2019 jewellery, gift &amp; toy collection, has been made especially for little wrists, small necks and tiny hands. Every aspect of our kids\u2019 jewellery, toys and gifts can be personalised with names, dates and messages. You can also add colourful birthstones, pearls and charms making Mini Bloom the perfect place to turn children\u2019s moments into memories. A great new addition to Mini Bloom is the Jellycat soft toy collection.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We also offer men's jewellery and gifts so you can create everything from Personalised Men's Name Bracelets to Engraved Silver Cufflinks, Watches, Pens and Hip Flasks.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We pride ourselves on taking care of individual needs. The Jewellers at Bloom Boutique are dedicated to creating one of a kind personalised gifts and our Dispatch Team hand-pick each personalised gift card presenting it with the jewellery or gift in a luxury Bloom Boutique gift box.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">No matter the occasion, from Christmas, Weddings, Anniversaries, Mother\u2019s Day, Father\u2019s Day and Valentine's Day, friend\u2019s Birthdays, or simply gifts for him and her, we have the personalised jewellery or gift to suit the occasion.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>We have a fantastic range of:<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Gifts for her<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Gifts for him<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Necklaces<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Bracelets<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Earrings<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Personalised Jewellery<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Women\u2019s gifts &amp; Jewellery<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Wedding gifts &amp; Jewellery<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022&nbsp;Charm Jewellery<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"