 padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Contact details<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">If you would like to discuss any aspect of the programme further or require additional information then please do not hesitate to contact the AO Affiliate Team, email:&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:affiliate@ao.com\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">affiliate@ao.com<\/a><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Under the AO plc umbrella we&nbsp; also have<\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Mobile Phones Direct<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">AO Business<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Boots Kitchen Appliances<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;so please get in touch if you are also interested in advertising these brands.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Voucher Codes:<\/span><\/h4><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- AO may from time to time issue promotion or voucher codes in an effort to promote sales. Publishers should only promote voucher codes that are provided to it in writing or otherwise through the Affiliate Program. AO reserves the right to withhold payment of commission if non-authorised voucher codes are used in connection with Relevant Sales.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Voucher code terms and conditions specified by AO (VCTCs) must be clearl