ou give them James Wellbeloved. Inspired by nature, our wholesome, tasty recipes will keep them  full of energy and loving life for years to come.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">James Wellbeloved DE Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">For 30 years, pet owners have trusted us to help keep their furry friends happy, healthy and full of life.&nbsp;At James Wellbeloved we make healthy, delicious food that helps your pet eat and live better.&nbsp;Our tasty recipes are prepared with natural ingredients and are healthy for your pet.&nbsp;Because we all want our pets to love their food and live healthier, happier lives.&nbsp;<br><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Commission<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">James Wellbeloved pays a 3% commission on all one off purchases and a 10% commission on all subscription purchases. For extra exposure opportunities and increased commissions, please contact the Affiliate Account Manager.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Current Promotions<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please refer to the Toolbox for the latest creatives and offers. Please get in touch directly if you require any specific images, banners or assets.&nbsp;<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; pa