earch engines.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">It is important to note that affiliates must not use the display URL including any variation of this.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Any affiliate using this display URL may be removed from the programme.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates may not use trademarks term as a subdomain in their URL e.g.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates must use their own website which can include trademarks in the sub folders of the display URL e.g. www.affiliatesite.com\/Jameswellbeloved<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Email policy<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates are not permitted to send any unsolicited email (\"spam\") under this Affiliate programme. Should you wish to send out a James Wellbeloved DE email please discuss with EssenceMediaCom in the first instance.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Purchasing of domain names<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates cannot use any domain names that include the James Wellbeloved brands.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Discount\/Voucher Codes<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Only codes that are supplied to affiliates by James Wellbeloved DE are valid for affiliate use. Any codes that are found to be displayed on sites that are non-approved will result in commissions being declined. Please make sure any URL strings you grab from the James Wellbeloved site are placed into the deep link generator via your own affiliate account that the URL does not contain any additional tracking information\/tags as this will cause the link to not track correctly.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">If you have any questions regarding this programme please contact the&nbsp;James Wellbeloved affiliate team at EssenceMediacom.<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.jameswellbeloved.de\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=43095&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:06:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:46:11.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"jameswellbeloved.de"}}  
