;FCC,&nbsp;and&nbsp;ROHS&nbsp;standards,&nbsp;have&nbsp;exported&nbsp;to&nbsp;more&nbsp;than&nbsp;192&nbsp;countries&nbsp;including,&nbsp;but&nbsp;not&nbsp;limited&nbsp;to&nbsp;France,&nbsp;the&nbsp;United&nbsp;States&nbsp;of&nbsp;America,&nbsp;Australia,&nbsp;Russia,&nbsp;the&nbsp;United&nbsp;Kingdom,&nbsp;Germany,&nbsp;Singapore,&nbsp;Egypt,&nbsp;and&nbsp;India,&nbsp;bringing&nbsp;technological&nbsp;innovation&nbsp;to&nbsp;all&nbsp;walks&nbsp;of&nbsp;life.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">To participate in store.creality.com Affliate Referal Program, the affiliate registration form must be completed and submitted to store.creality.com. All applicants, once approved, are immediately eligible to participate in store.creality.com Affliate Referral Program however such participants are subject to ongoing , periodic review by store.creality.com and maybe revoked at anytime without notice. Participation may be suspended or terminated if we determine (at our sole discretion) that your site is unsuitable for the Program. Unsuitable sites include those that : Promote illegal activities Promote sexually explicit materials Promote violence Promote discrimination based on race, sex, region, nationally, sexual orientation, or age Violate intellectual property rights Or are otherwise deemed inconsistent with the best of store.creality.com This agreement shall apply only to Affiliate onwed and managed web sites as indicated in the registration form. Under no circumstances, store.creality.com Affiliate Referral link be placed on sites not registered with store.creality.com. Not allowed to use domains containing the brand's name Not allowed to use the brand's name in the subdomain on the publisher's own domain Not allowed to bid on brand's name(including misspellings and variations) and Adwords, adcenter, etc...<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;