":"Uniquely designed Surfboards for ocean and river surfing. Born in Germany, developed in France with sustainability as our main focus.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">KANOA Surfboards DE Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>WE ARE KANOA SURFBOARDS<\/b><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">With our unique surfboard shaping approach and guidance we will do everything to get you the maximum wave count and surfing pleasure. Every board is designed to meet the sweet spot between performance and effortless wave catching. With our board finders we indicate your ideal board choice and our friendly, experienced service team will be available for any further questions.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Every KANOA surfboard combines unique design, high quality standards and we are focussed on premium customer service.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We are striving to replace conventional materials with natural fibers, recycled materials and develop new ways of creating performing and durable surfing equipment. On our journey we will not rest until we find responsible alternatives for every part of our surfing equipment and will follow our goal of a 100% recyclable surfboard.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p>No terms<br><\/p>","url":"https:\/\/kanoa-surfboards.com\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=29417&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:06:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:46:32.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,