0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Text links and creative can be found within the interface.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">As Boden runs a successful in-house PPC advertising campaign, we have prepared the following guidelines to ensure there is no conflict between ourselves and our affiliates.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In order to qualify for a Boden affiliate, you must accept these conditions.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please note that Boden are currently only accepting new affiliates that have a strong content focus in the verticals of fashion, lifestyle or parenting.&nbsp; This is so we can have a greater control of our branding within the affiliate channel.&nbsp; However, please feel free to contact the Boden affiliate team if you\u2019re keen to promote the brand.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Publishers of the Boden programme may only promote codes, offers and deals that are communicated via the affiliate channel.&nbsp; Boden may decline sales that are gained through promotion of an expired or unauthorised code, offer or deal. This programme does not accept&nbsp;browser extension tools.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><h4>Use of voucher codes