d on any domain names with the word \u2018Boden\u2019 or misspellings of \u2018Boden\u2019 in the URL. For example, wwwbodenusa.com, wwwboden.co.uk, wwwboden.co.uk<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Display Boden garments on Froogle\u2122 as we have our own Froogle\u2122 feeds already in place<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00b7Conduct any form of typosquatting. Typosquatting is a form of cybersquatting which directs a person to a false website when they enter a misspelling of the intended website. For example, www.bodan.co.uk, www.bodunusa.com<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;\">Boden take the above guidelines very seriously and reserve the right to deny commission for the month that an affiliate has been keyword bidding or typosquatting. Boden will also consider banning affiliates who ignore these guidelines.<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><p><\/p>","url":"http:\/\/www.bodenclothing.com.au\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=10763&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:05:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T11:55:15.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"bodenclothing.com.au"}}  
