ription":"Since 2007 BrewDog has been on a mission to make other people as passionate about great craft beer as they are.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Brewdog - DE Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>About BrewDog<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Since 2007 BrewDog has been on a mission to make other people as passionate about great craft beer as they are. From the Headliner series, which includes bold, uncompromising pack leaders like the flagship Punk IPA, to the Amplified range (beer, but turned up to 11), BrewDog brews beer that blows people\u2019s minds and has kick-started a revolution.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Cofounders James Watt and Martin Dickie shook up the business world in 2010 with the launch of pioneering crowdfunding initiative Equity for Punks, an initiative that has seen the company raise \u00a374m over six rounds, with their latest round open until April 2020. The funds and the army of punk shareholders (200,000+) has enabled the Scottish craft brewery to scale up its operations.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">With 101 bars across the globe, export into 60 countries, and breweries in Columbus Ohio, Berlin Germany and Brisbane Australia, BrewDog continues to take the craft beer revolution stratospheric, whilst continuing to push the boundaries, invest in people, put the beer first, become the world's first carbon negative brewery and champion other small breweries in its venues.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Why BrewDog?<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">As one of the world\u2019s biggest independent craft breweries BrewDog is all about choice. With new beers added every week and an online range including ciders, alcohol free beer,&nbsp;sprits and merchandise there is plenty to keep people interested from the avid craft beer nerd to the occasional drinker happy.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Online Shop -&nbsp;<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.brewdog.com\/uk\/shop\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">https:\/\/www.brewdog.com\/uk\/shop<\/a><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Customer Benefits:&nbsp;<\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">The only place to buy all BrewDog beers<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">New beers released every week<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Range includes Cider, Spirts, Alcohol-Free and Merchandise<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Free UK delivery whenever you fill your box<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Planet BrewDog loyalty scheme<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Every order is carbon negative, the planets favourite beer.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Publisher Benefits:&nbsp;<\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">8% commission for&nbsp;new customers<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">3% commission for&nbsp;exisitng customers<\/span><\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">AOV of over \u00a350<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Conv Rate of over 7%<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Includes BrewDog Beers, Cider, Spirits and Merchandise<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We encourage publishers to promote us on their websites and social media accounts, but we don't currently allow PPC bidding.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Interested in becoming an affiliate?<\/span><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Simply email any enquiries to: affiliates@brewdog.com<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>About BrewDog<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Since 2007 BrewDog has been on a mission to make other people as passionate about great craft beer as they are. From the Headliner series, which includes bold, uncompromising pack leaders like the flagship Punk IPA, to the Amplified range (beer, but turned up to 11), BrewDog brews beer that blows people\u2019s minds and has kick-started a revolution.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Cofounders James Watt and Martin Dickie shook up the business world in 2010 with the launch of pioneering crowdfunding initiative Equity for Punks, an initiative that has seen the company raise \u00a374m over six rounds, with their latest round open until April 2020. The funds and the army of punk