ef=\"http:\/\/kayosports.com.au\/\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"outline: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(2, 95, 162);\">KitchenAid.com.au<\/a>&nbsp;from a 3rd party, especially sources that are based outside of AU.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\">PARTNER&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">cannot create social media<\/span>&nbsp;(including but not limited to Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, YouTube and Snapchat). accounts\/pages\/profiles\/channels, groups, events, posts, comments or paid ads, pretending to be our brand in an effort to market yourselves as our brand.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\">PARTNER should request permission before promoting KitchenAid&nbsp;<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">via email or any means other than as agreed in this EIO<\/span>.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Last Click Attribution&nbsp;<\/span>- Tracked conversions are de-duped on a last click basis against other marketing channels, for e.g. search, email advertising, display advertising, direct partnerships, price comparison, etc.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Additional activities&nbsp;<\/span>\u2013 from time to time, PARTNER and KitchenAid Australia may agree to engage in additional media or marketing activities, including but not limited to direct displays (such as EDMs), media placements and sponsored editorial (\u201cAdditional Activities\u201d). Payment for these Additional Activities may be through Impact or as otherwise agreed by the parties. If the parties engage in any Additional Activities, these Custom Terms shall apply.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Marketing and Promotional Plan<\/span>&nbsp;\u2013 PARTNER will use best endeavours to maximise the publicity of KitchenAid and any Additional Activities, which may be conducted in accordance with a marketing and promotional plan to be agreed between the parties.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 5px; list-style: disc;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Staff purchases<\/span>&nbsp;- Staff Promo Codes are non-commissionable. Any sales using a staff promo code will be cancelled and commissions reversed.<\/li><\/ol><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>","url":"http:\/\/kitchenaid.com.au\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/kitchenaid-australia.pxf.io\/c\/4101692\/719433\/10789","type":"api","created_at":"2023-04-17T05:12:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T11:44:57.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":1,"custom_domain":"kitchenaid.com.au"}}  
