cocktail and special occasion dresses to stylish women. Adrianna Papell is now a top style destination for every woman and every occasion.","description":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\">Founded in the heart of NYC\u2019s fashion district in 1980, Adrianna Papell began with a mission to help women feel their most beautiful. We understand real women and your wish to not only look your best, but also feel your best for all those special moments, both big and small. Fast forward to today, Adrianna Papell is recognized as being one of fashion\u2019s most recognized names in the special occasion dress business by stylish women all over the globe.<\/span><br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:933,&quot;y&quot;:45,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:17,&quot;abs_x&quot;:1186,&quot;abs_y&quot;:321}\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:7,&quot;y&quot;:64,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:17,&quot;abs_x&quot;:260,&quot;abs_y&quot;:340}\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\">We are inspired by our customers and take great pride in providing an exquisite sense of style, a dream fit, and thoughtful, meticulous craftsmanship. Our collections are imbued with an elegance and strength that empowers and inspires women of all\u202fages, sizes, figures and backgrounds. Each piece we make is designed with purpose and perspective, creativity and dedication.\u202fWe celebrate life\u2019s most important moments by celebrating the women who experience them, and we strive to wear life beautifully each day\u2014with joy, optimism, warmth, and true style.<\/span><br bis_size=\"{&quot;x&quot;:595,&quot;y&quot;:140,&quot;w&quot;:0,&quot;h&quot;:17,&quot;abs_x&quot;:848,&quot;abs_y&quot;:416}\" style=\"color: rg