px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Making music is becoming increasingly popular and the number of music schools, both in the private and public sectors, is constantly growing. With Donner, the customers you refer will find a large assortment, good prices and detailed advice.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><h6 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25;\">Advantages for the publisher:<\/h6><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">High shopping baskets (approx. \u20ac160)<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Product data updated daily with detailed descriptions and photos<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Low returns<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Commission: 11% sale of the shopping cart value<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Integrate our high-performance advertising material on your website and start earning money.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">If you have any questions, please contact:<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u00bb Email: affiliate@donnerde.com<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Sign up for our other affiliate programs via:<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">TradeTracker UK: idonner.eu (ID: 34926)<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Tradedoubler FR: donnerfr.com (ID: 331962)<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; ma