n":"Designed in the UK, Bedroom Athletics manufacture and retail premium quality slippers and loungewear that do not compromise on style.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Bedroom Athletics Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Ban Boring Loungewear<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We\u2019ve been making luxury slippers and beautiful bed and loungewear since 2007.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Our mission back then was to&nbsp;\u2018ban boring bedwear\u2019&nbsp;and to make feeling comfortable at home a beautiful experience too.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Today we sell a wide range of luxury slippers, boots, mules, clogs and slides for men and women. We have a range of super soft and comfortable dressing gowns for men and women.&nbsp;We also sell a small, select range of luxurious accessories for the home.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Our products are now sold in more than 20 countries worldwide, and offer true style and comfort, for lounging, relaxing, working from home or getting outdoors.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Committed to quality<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We combine contemporary British design with the softest Grade-A Australian sheepskin, quality fabrics from Harris Tweed, luxurious fleece, butter soft suede and crisp cotton weaves, plus a new range of Vegan Friendly options, all perfect for lounging, relaxing, working from home or getting outdoors.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We\u2019re committed to quality and it\u2019s what keeps our customers coming back.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">WHY JOIN THE BEDROOM ATHLETICS AFFILIATE PROGRAMME?<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>COMMISSION<\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">You can earn up to 8% commission on all approved sales.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>CREATIVE<\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Creative banners available to use right now.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Opportunity to request bespoke banners.<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>COMMUNICATION<\/b><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Regular communication to Publishers.<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Afilliate Marketing Team on hand to answer any questions.<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","program_policies":"<div class=\"col-lg-12\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; min-height: 1px; float: left; width: 870.25px;\"><div id=\"termsFreeTextContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea \" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin