55 Luxembourg (hereinafter: \"Amazon\"), subject to the Amazon Payments Europe User Agreement, which can be viewed at&nbsp;<\/font><a href=\"https:\/\/payments.amazon.de\/help\/201751590\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(255, 102, 0); cursor: pointer; transition-property: color; transition-duration: 0.2s;\">https:\/\/payments.amazon.de\/help\/201751590<\/a><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;.&nbsp;<\/font><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">If the customer selects \u201cAmazon Payments\u201d as the payment method as part of the online ordering process, he also issues a payment order to Amazon by clicking the button that completes the ordering process.&nbsp;<\/font><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">In this case, the seller declares acceptance of the customer's offer at the time the customer initiates the payment process by clicking on the button that completes the ordering process.<\/font><\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">2.6<\/span><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;When submitting an offer via the seller's online order form, the contract text is saved by the seller after the contract has been concluded and sent to the customer in text form (e.g. e-mail, fax or letter) after the order has been sent.&nbsp;<\/font><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">The seller will not make the contract text available beyond this.&nbsp;<\/font><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">If the customer has set up a user account in the seller's online shop before sending his order, the order data will be archived on the seller's website and can be accessed free of charge by the customer via his password-protected user account by providing the corresponding login data.<\/font><\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">2.7<\/span><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Before bindingly submitting the order via the seller's online order form, the customer can identify possible input errors by carefully reading the information displayed on the screen.&nbsp;<\/font><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">An effective technical means of better detecting input errors can be the browser's magnification function, which enlarges the display on the screen.&nbsp;<\/font><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">As part of the electronic ordering process, the customer can correct his entries using the usual keyboard and mouse functions until he clicks on the button that completes the ordering process.<\/font><\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">2.8<\/span><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Only the German language is available for concluding the contract.<\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">2.9<\/span><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Order processing and contact usually take place via email and automated order processing.&nbsp;<\/font><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">The customer must ensure that the email address he provided to process the order is correct so that emails sent by the seller can be received at this address.&nbsp;<\/font><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">In particular, when using SPAM filters, the customer must ensure that all emails sent by the seller or by third parties commissioned by the seller to process the order can be delivered.<\/font><\/font><\/p><p><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: inherit;\">3) RIGHT OF WITHDRAWAL<\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">3.1<\/span><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Consumers generally have a right of withdrawal.<\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">3.2<\/span><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Further information on the right of withdrawal can be found in the seller's cancellation policy.<\/font><\/p><p><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: inherit;\">4) PRICES AND PAYMENT TERMS<\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">4.1<\/span><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Unless otherwise stated in the seller's product description, the prices stated are total prices and include statutory sales tax.&nbsp;<\/font><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">Any additional delivery and shipping costs that may arise will be stated separately in the respective product description.<\/font><\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">4.2<\/span><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;The payment option(s) will be communicated to the customer in the seller's online shop.<\/font><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: 600;\">4.3<\/span><font style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;If advance payment by bank transfer has been agreed, 