he UK. From our humble beginnings, we\u2019ve blossomed into an international clothing giant and are widely recognised as a leader in online fashion.","description":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Welcome to the Boden affiliate programme.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Boden is one of the most successful and fastest growing online clothing companies in the UK. From our humble beginnings, we\u2019ve blossomed into an international clothing giant and are widely recognised as a leader in online fashion.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We do a pretty good job of making beautiful, colourful clothes for all the family that are sure to put a spring in anyone\u2019s step. You will find great pieces for babies, kids and teens in our Mini Boden and johnnieb ranges and timeless styles in our womenswear and menswear lines.<\/p><table style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; max-width: 100%;\"><tbody style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><h4>Benefits:<\/h4><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Earn 6% commission (3% for Voucher &amp; Cashback Affiliates)<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 A high $175 average order value<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Great discounts and incentives for your customers<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Access to our entire product inventory via a Product Feed<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Timely commission payments<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 A Dedicated affiliate management team<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>","program_policies":"<p><\/p><table style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; max-width: 100%;\"><tbody style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-top: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border-top: 0px;\">The important thing to know is that if you become a Boden affiliate, you can \u2013 without any risk \u2013 enjoy part of our phenomenal success. Our thriving affiliate program benefits from a high commission rate and frequent promotions to encourage greater conversions.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><h4>So what are the benefits?<\/h4><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Earn 6% commission (3% for Voucher &amp; Cashback Affiliates)<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 A high $175 average order value<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Great discounts and incentives for your customers<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Access to our entire product inventory via a Product Feed<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 Timely commission payments<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\u2022 A Dedicated affiliate management team<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Text links and creative can be found within the interface.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">As Boden runs a successful in-house PPC advertising campaign, we have prepared the following guidelines to ensure there is no conflict between ourselves and our affiliates.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">In order to qualify for a Boden affiliate, you must accept these conditions.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please note that Boden are currently only accepting new affiliates that have a strong content focus in the verticals of fashion, lifestyle or parenting.&nbsp; This is so we can have a greater control of our branding within the affiliate channel.&nbsp; However, please feel free to contact the Boden affiliate team if you\u2019re keen to promote the brand.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Publishers of the Boden programme may only promote codes, offers and deals that are communicated via the affiliate channel.&nbsp; Boden may decline sales that are gained through promotion of an expired or unauthorised code, offer or deal. This programme does not accept&nbsp;browser extension tools.<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><h4>Use of voucher 