e order value of 55 EUR and a strong conversion rate of 1.5%.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Our most popular treatments&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Prevention of erectile dysfunction<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">Chlamydia infection<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">cystitis<\/li><li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none;\">High cholesterol<\/li><\/ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Please note that you will not receive any commission on the prescription fee or delivery costs. Only commissions for sold medicines are paid out.&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">If you have any questions about Capsule or our affiliate marketing program, please contact affiliates@gocapsule.de<\/p><p style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: &quot;Whitney SSm A&quot;, &quot;Whitney SSm B&quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Kapsel (bisher Medzino) Affiliate-Marketing Programm Gesch\u00e4ftsbedingungen<\/b><\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Wir behalten uns vor, nach belieben und zu jeder Zeit \u00c4nderungen an den Gesch\u00e4ftsbedingungen vorzunehmen. Wir werden stets danach streben, Sie mindestens sieben Tage vor dem Inkrafttreten allf\u00e4lliger \u00c4nderungen dar\u00fcber in Kenntnis zu setzen. Nichteinhaltung der Gesch\u00e4ftsbedingungen kann zu einer Zur\u00fcckbehaltung oder Nichtbezahlung der 