 working with you.<\/p><\/div>","program_policies":"<p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Affiliates who are found in breach of our terms and conditions will have their commissions set to zero and maybe suspended from the programme.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Please note<\/b><\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Please note, as we operate our own CPC marketing programmes on Google and Microsoft Bing, we would respectfully ask affiliates not to bid on any keywords including the term \u2018Gear4music\u2019 or use Google Shopping to trigger ads on our products.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">-Publishers with active paid media coverage ( text and shopping) on Google &amp; Microsoft will be rejected or removed from the Gear4music affiliate program.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Unfortunately, we are unable to work with CSS partners, cashback, voucher code or other incentive websites.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">- Unfortunately we are unable to work with any Voucher Code or Discount Code sites.<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">&nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Thank You<\/p><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We are very much looking forward to working with you.<\/p>","url":"https:\/\/www.gear4music.de\/de\/","click_through_url":"https:\/\/www.awin1.com\/awclick.php?mid=27578&id=1263017","type":"api","created_at":"2023-03-21T07:06:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T09:44:29.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"is_show":0,"is_request__process":0,"is_active":0,"custom_domain":"