rgone a rebranding to better align with our mission to support head shavers across the globe.Our 4th generation head shaver is a revolutionary machine that promises the easiest head shave to date.","description":"<h4 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 15px !important;\">Goldskull Pro Affiliate Program<\/h4><div id=\"descriptionLongContentView\" class=\"inlineTextArea ck-editable-icon\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px;\">We are GoldSkull - skull polishers &amp; head enhancers. We exist to destroy dodgy comb overs and wistful head sprouts. We celebrate bald, shaved &amp; buzzed.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Ears, nose, beard and body also welcome to the shaving party with our 6in1 shavers<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Our head and body shavers have been designed to provide effortless shaving for men and women. Packed full of accessories, we have you covered from your head to your toes. Try GoldSkull today and look forward to a lifetime of satisfying shaves.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><b>Shaving your head can be a pain.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><\/b>GoldSkull is the world's first electric razor for shaving heads, and it\u2019s designed to make life easier for those who shave their heads every day. It features a patented blade system that cuts hair at skin level so you get an ultra-close shave without any nicks or irritation. The ergonomic design is easy to hold and use, even with one hand. And its powerful battery will last up to 90 minutes on a single charge \u2013 enough time for most people to shave their entire head&nbsp;multiple times before needing another charge!<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\